onsumers and invariants together; a rejected new operation must leave the predecessor usable and already owned effects reconcilable.\n\nAcceptance and nonregression: valid boundary values and values just beyond each synthetic cap, final wrapper/receipt growth, non-ASCII strings, arbitrarily split frames/pages, malformed or conflicting data, mixed-version decode and save/reopen round trips. Exercise the precise source-described failure path and the relevant byte/count/elapsed boundaries listed in this finding, plus ordinary small inputs. Check that legitimate work progresses after the former blocker while malformed input, conflicting identity, stale preimages and unauthorized scope still reject. Add fault injection at the affected acceptance/publication/recovery boundary and run the affected integration and formal checks on the final implementation. Source-derived risks remain distinct from executed reproductions; completion requires this evidence, not a promise that a plan alone cannot break anything.","created_at":"2026-10-06T13:21:37.467Z","kind":"decision"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNciB+Zk+P+b/T/mQpduMxecG83nKvMOmczjoYuImrJmH/qaBr2s9Ldb+6cugqTe3j6QaifT4xTP5XHIc0fJ+wo="}
{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2403,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:21:37.837886801Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"d056ad9c-597a-52c8-976e-031fe6f23b75","title":"[L165] Durable effect receipts have fixed per-record and lifetime storage ceilings","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L165.\n\n- Source: `crates/app/peritus-product-runner/src/developer_tools/receipt.rs:21-23,181-221`; `receipt/storage.rs:44-88,96-105`.\n- The ledger rejects a serialized record above **2 MiB** and refuses appends that would take the entire journal above **128 MiB**. Applied and Completed records each retain the complete result, so successful effects consume result storage twice. The encoded envelope consumes part of the 2 MiB allowance; a tool result at that size cannot fit a receipt at the same ceiling.\n- Starting a new effect requires appending Started first. Applied and Completed persistence can fail after execution. The ceiling therefore affects both admission and recording already performed work, including command-control tools routed through the ledger. Out-of-band control paths remain to be traced; this does not establish that every cancellation mechanism is blocked.\n- Loading allocates the entire file before checking its 128 MiB size. There is no compaction, retirement, segmented storage, or configurable lifetime allowance in these files. **Source-confirmed; live journal size and full caller recovery remain unverified.**\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQL/g