{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2409,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:21:37.851081662Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"80a39ee4-47f9-5715-8e9c-64024e4fcabe","title":"[L168] Explicit external-reference reads have fixed discovery and path-recognition bounds","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L168.\n\n- Source: `crates/app/peritus-product-runner/src/developer_tools/reference.rs:22,30-58,70-149,166-319`.\n- External listing stops after **512 entries** and constrains depth to **1–6**, default **3**. It exposes a truncated flag but no offset or continuation cursor. Callers can list named descendants separately; discovery is still bounded independently of actual directory size. Each directory is fully collected and sorted before limiting its output, and child enumeration/metadata errors are silently omitted.\n- Reads share the existing file-size/default-500-line/range escape and output-prefix bounds (L041/L045). Reference authority requires a normal absolute path recognized in task text, at most **4,096 bytes**, without a URL or control characters. Tokens lose terminal punctuation including a final period, which can change a legitimate filename. Quoted tokens support spaces, but there is no general shell/path escape grammar.\n- Case-insensitive component matching applies on every platform when excluding the workspace and selecting an authority root; on a case-sensitive filesystem, distinct paths that differ only by case can therefore be misclassified. The filesystem resolver prefers an exact spelling and rejects ambiguous fallback names. Named targets/descendants reject symlinks; system-alias ancestors of the named root are intentionally accepted. Preserve explicit authority while repairing recognition or traversal restrictions. **Full source and inline test read; not exercised.**\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBsD3E3uxSN8q7lWlAfS6bUMv6NpoSgmzUH3Hl64X2VvsiwHRcwMKRoUC+/5CShOaZr3hi6sr4OHmNzu+cZPaAg="}
