{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2429,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:21:37.896324533Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"ba318ae3-a360-57d4-8743-dc2101407380","title":"[L266] Outbox claim/acknowledgment errors terminate the worker without retry or live health publication","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L266.\n\n- Source: `crates/app/peritus-daemon/src/outbox/pump.rs:14-51,61-85`; `outbox/router.rs:78-88`; journal error recovery in L257.\n- Clock allocation, authority.claim_outbox, and generic acknowledgment use `?`, ending the owned task on any error. They bypass the delivery-error branch that explicitly enters read-only. A typed Retry storage/busy error is therefore not actually retried by this worker.\n- OutboxRuntime exposes start and shutdown only in its complete implementation. It retains the JoinHandle result until shutdown; this component supplies no live health/status notification or restart loop. The complete `startup/runtime.rs:69-182` shutdown wait watches only signals, shutdown requests, and the server task, with no outbox or authority task completion branch. The complete startup runner likewise installs no health watcher. The result can be a running daemon whose durable delivery worker has stopped; that supervision gap is now source-confirmed.\n- The sole pump awaits one delivery before claiming another and checks stop only between attempts or during idle polling. A stuck handler can block all destinations and defer shutdown to the configured abort deadline (L264). Repair requires an owned, observable, recoverable delivery lifecycle with the exact claim identity, not another hidden work timeout. **Whole component and routing source read; live busy/stuck-handler reproduction not performed.**\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQIuNp729/iQFcXEI01Lx6eArApBdfxaeCw4DbyZH0M7bldZZa16MQOy4/4356S63nKCA8rW9lIbXcaVp2P+sUAI="}
