{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2459,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:21:37.967973169Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"0e85c494-ffd5-5940-a329-9f2d1c8f56c8","title":"[L302] Collaboration confuses message identity order with causal order, rejecting valid successors or saving an invalid chain","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L302.\n\n- Source: `crates/orchestration/peritus-collaboration/src/state/mutation.rs:30-37`; `reducer/apply.rs:196-220`; `message.rs:48-65`; `state/validation.rs:21-38`; `wire/mod.rs:357-383`; `wire/state.rs:105-141`; `durability.rs:59-80,124-145,234-240`.\n- Messages are retained sorted by **message ID**. SendMessage gathers that order, derives expected ordinal from the count, and chooses task_messages.last() as the required predecessor. It never verifies that selected predecessor has ordinal=expected-1. Restart validation requires exactly that causal ordinal relationship.\n- Source-derived sequence: message A has ordinal 1 and a greater ID than later message B, whose ordinal 2 correctly names A. A third message at ordinal 3 correctly naming B is rejected because admission selects A as the greatest ID. Naming A instead passes admission even though A has ordinal 1; that accepted successor can encode/commit but fails restart validation because 1+1 != 3.\n- Stable IDs are opaque identities, not required monotonic timestamps. This is an ordering-model blocker and another accepted-state/decoder disagreement. Repair should retain/derive a checked per-task causal frontier, independent of identity sort order, and enforce the same relationship before acceptance and at restart. **Complete admission, insertion, constructor, wire, persistence and decoder chain read; no executable reproduction claimed.**\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBjFe1axnw4+z4ANtRvz994dqvlMWACDRJdA4d/4bV4kvnCCHsR8fGuL7L0pV3EMLgqQmf7qpMiocqzZh4OsSw4="}
