nAcceptance and nonregression: large-file and many-path capture/restore, divergent preimage rejection, interrupted staging/publication/restore, then reopen and continue the same conversation with an exact restored workspace. Exercise the precise source-described failure path and the relevant byte/count/elapsed boundaries listed in this finding, plus ordinary small inputs. Check that legitimate work progresses after the former blocker while malformed input, conflicting identity, stale preimages and unauthorized scope still reject. Add fault injection at the affected acceptance/publication/recovery boundary and run the affected integration and formal checks on the final implementation. Source-derived risks remain distinct from executed reproductions; completion requires this evidence, not a promise that a plan alone cannot break anything.","created_at":"2026-10-06T13:21:37.467Z","kind":"decision"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQAcZ0ULh/m/x30T9ThXTNo7+Amo4i/o5JDCdlhW8abb/QyQlmId2mbta9NkstsBbkz3+e4Tw8DuCU0GttbmI2w8="}
{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2485,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:21:38.027071370Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"97d36902-0a99-500f-9c2a-df54f6301864","title":"[L315] E0 can commit a valid large D2 terminal observation that its own decoder rejects","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L315.\n\n- **Source:** `crates/orchestration/peritus-review/src/limits.rs:56-86`; `crates/orchestration/peritus-orchestrator/src/child/review.rs:219-308`; `src/canonical/wire/observation/quality.rs:41-77,98-124`; `src/reducer/apply/role_cycle.rs:164-217`; `src/state/validation.rs:38-98,242-303`; `src/verified.rs:82-95`; `src/durability.rs:69-87,190-213,376-381`; `src/wire/state.rs:302-311` (remaining paths in the orchestrator crate).\n- **Blocker:** D2 permits up to 65,535 findings. Its checked E0 adapter copies every unconserved finding into the observation without a 1,024 cap. E0 observation writing uses the shared production collection limit (65,535), but `read_review` and `read_review_fixer` impose `MAX_ARTIFACT_REFERENCES` (1,024). E0 state validation checks the review's run/binding/revision but not that decoder-specific finding ceiling.\n- **Consequence:** Given a valid terminal D2 NeedsHuman/Failed/Cancelled observation with 1,025 sorted unconserved findings, the typed E0 reducer can admit it with no fixer handoff, retain it, and the durability API can encode/commit its event and checkpoint if their byte budgets fit. Reload rejects the event's 1,025-item finding vector as corrupt and returns Codec/Quarantine. A transport caller that decodes the command first instead rejects legitimate D2 truth before admission. NeedsFix cannot simply omit the excess findings because the fixer handoff must conserve the exact set and separately caps it at artifact_references.\n- **Repair direction:** Make domain admission, encoding and decoding share a versioned admissibility contract. Represent large finding sets through paged digest-bound evidence rather than converting an artifact input ceiling into a finding ceiling. Prove that every accepted durable successor is decodable under its stored binding, including terminal non-success and cancellation truth.\n- **Evidence scope:** Source-derived conditional counterexample with exact count mismatch; no large D2 fixture or poisoned SQLite journal was executed. This is the same accepted-versus-reload structural defect seen in L296/L297/L301, not an attribution of the live session's current failure.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBGlHvTYm5+r03QnCV31Z6mcfQbviOzoJIpwogUHioen6ULx+XiW5aYrxgld34o0g4lyrNtSti0SDbbs+13upQc="}
