consumers and invariants together; a rejected new operation must leave the predecessor usable and already owned effects reconcilable.\n\nAcceptance and nonregression: valid boundary values and values just beyond each synthetic cap, final wrapper/receipt growth, non-ASCII strings, arbitrarily split frames/pages, malformed or conflicting data, mixed-version decode and save/reopen round trips. Exercise the precise source-described failure path and the relevant byte/count/elapsed boundaries listed in this finding, plus ordinary small inputs. Check that legitimate work progresses after the former blocker while malformed input, conflicting identity, stale preimages and unauthorized scope still reject. Add fault injection at the affected acceptance/publication/recovery boundary and run the affected integration and formal checks on the final implementation. Source-derived risks remain distinct from executed reproductions; completion requires this evidence, not a promise that a plan alone cannot break anything.","created_at":"2026-10-06T13:24:48.544Z","kind":"decision"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJutCjghSjLYeVGdRt8UsYHKbYUUgRqwgINNhZ1rY8SVoqEdQzWBThmBNS9S7RXfHAwNUKXZ7bHEcDaVwZS6Xg8="}
{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2507,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:24:48.716415382Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"953aa672-a28f-565c-b6fd-68b26326600b","title":"[L178] Public-reply compaction is unavailable while execution remains incomplete","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L178.\n\n- Source: `crates/app/peritus-daemon/src/product_control/compaction.rs:13,37-98,126-148`.\n- The host compaction preview returns no proposal when execution is incomplete. Once complete, it always retains the **two most recent eligible unpinned replies** in full, preserves all pinned replies, and only compacts older eligible sources that the existing prompt-view reducer can save. This controls user-visible public-reply compaction; it is separate from the developer loop's local-context compactor.\n- Eligibility itself requires successfully loading/validating the complete conversation and capturing mandatory inputs. Compaction cannot bypass a failure at those earlier history/request ceilings. Original source replies remain durable, and the production input caller still charges their original sizes (L157).\n- Generation increments are checked u64 and preview counts checked u32; owner/workspace/revision checks are authority fences rather than artificial lifetimes. **Complete source read; host execution_complete producer and a stalled-run example remain pending.**\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCkbfKSNlFWFHN+4RBcDyjJq7IeXvaMLhknVT9l5Ovzg4AeHavKEjgUva7POcYb36lyD323Q