wned effects reconcilable.\n\nAcceptance and nonregression: long productive read/write sessions through repeated compaction and segment boundaries, source/dependency changes, non-ASCII and large evidence, interrupted checkpoint publication, then reopen the same lineage and prove that valid grounding is reused and stale targets are reread. Exercise the precise source-described failure path and the relevant byte/count/elapsed boundaries listed in this finding, plus ordinary small inputs. Check that legitimate work progresses after the former blocker while malformed input, conflicting identity, stale preimages and unauthorized scope still reject. Add fault injection at the affected acceptance/publication/recovery boundary and run the affected integration and formal checks on the final implementation. Source-derived risks remain distinct from executed reproductions; completion requires this evidence, not a promise that a plan alone cannot break anything.","created_at":"2026-10-06T13:24:48.544Z","kind":"decision"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQDZ0nlhZgfSatrXEiRupqF+mPXxMO5mlhxsq1AXU3f4Iy6JwsEMzZlZNbpWTo0yoC51sqoYxpLQve1rhifPHeQ4="}
{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2509,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:24:48.721008471Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"2a6ca8e6-01d9-5566-9760-39a24e64f3df","title":"[L179] Context inspection builds the complete next-view rows before pagination","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L179.\n\n- Source: `crates/app/peritus-daemon/src/product_control/context.rs:16-92,95-191,206-265`.\n- Read-only Next inspection loads the complete conversation, captures eligible inputs, constructs rows for every input revision, reply, image and file, and only then applies the protocol page limit. History inspection reads/validates each manifest on the selected page. The protocol page size is a presentation bound, not session expiration.\n- File rows recompute eligible_files for every entry; input/reply/image membership is also checked against vectors. Large retained histories can therefore cause repeated whole-history work before even a small page becomes visible. This is an unbenchmarked responsiveness risk, distinct from a measured lockup.\n- Failed conversation validation/capture or invalid retained metadata aborts inspection instead of exposing a repair projection. The exact actor/workspace/revision and immutable manifest fences remain necessary. **Full implementation read; live history size/performance and repair UI behavior not measured.**\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJxbohQAoaL0AIMX17ADslaACpmuobMY4vzpdOnH9ibao9CdO84tHE+AHx6wmbvIlRALTznyLw1us3PTqIUa9gQ="}
