{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2537,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:24:48.785732219Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"999d3b6e-6da5-50c9-9b5b-ab184447cc2a","title":"[L193] Preview behavior evidence must be found in the retained stdout tail and only after terminal state","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L193.\n\n- Source: `crates/app/peritus-daemon/src/product_run/workbench/launch/output.rs:12-13,33-61`; `launch/evidence.rs:10-43,171-258,270-291`.\n- Each preview retains only the last **128 KiB per stream**, then the public snapshot applies its separate protocol output bound. CheckPreviewBehavior rejects Accepted/Running launches and requires the observed text as a literal substring of that retained stdout. An earlier valid output omitted from the tail cannot satisfy the check through its durable full-output artifact in this method.\n- Graphical goal qualification additionally requires a bound build digest, process ID, ready launch, Exited/Stopped state, a positive behavior-check count, completed interaction before captured pixels and a later check. The check note must exactly equal one GraphicalPlaytest criterion description, and the live preview runtime map must still own that process. Duplicate matching criteria are rejected.\n- These are acceptance/provenance policies, not elapsed deadlines. Exact ordering, source/build freshness and user consent are integrity requirements; mandatory terminal state, literal tail-only verification and loss of the live owner after restart can prevent otherwise retained observations from qualifying. Correctness must be judged against the actual requested criterion.\n- Source/build hashing streams **64 KiB buffers without a total-file byte cap**; that buffer is not a limiter. **Full source and ordering tests read; no lost-tail/restart qualification case run.**\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNI15nMugv2yG23dpTwSpVCEevYpjgZSRdK4HpfNqdxWcgWjNCEA2ie7WDlwhDZ+d24bjQYCws9oC56MakUcWAo="}
