{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2551,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:24:48.818529087Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"aa07c5b7-d398-5b8d-b6d9-a0f2bc4c1324","title":"[L200] Worker admission and result retention share a fixed ceiling, and cleanup grace is mandatory and capped","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L200.\n\n- Source: `crates/app/peritus-daemon/src/worker/limits.rs:7-8,26-70`; `worker/supervisor.rs:61-83,151-185,199-249,297-302`.\n- The supervisor accepts at most **4,096 configured active tasks/results**. Production sets result capacity equal to active-task capacity and reaps at most **64 per ordinary pass**. A full result queue stops reaping finished tasks, which remain in the active-task map and can block new task admission until authoritative observations are drained. Dispatch ownership is retained through result consumption to prevent duplicate execution.\n- Shutdown grace and abort-join grace must both be positive and at most **10 minutes**; production fixes abort-join grace at **5 seconds**. Cooperative cancellation is followed by task abort and a second finite join window. Abort-resistant tasks remain in an Unclean report; Drop requests abort without joining them. These deadlines are shutdown-specific, not automatic worker session expiration. **5 ms** polling is an observation cadence.\n- A shutdown with terminal observations is Unclean until those observations are externally settled, even when no task remains. The inspected daemon caller records their count rather than settling them in this method. General worker admission/result-draining callers remain pending.\n- **Both files fully read; no queue-pressure or abort-resistant task reproduction.** These constructors reject larger/unbounded operational choices regardless of host capacity.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQP0ZNvVFYFxfb5GOfHUuPrDhdEOQzqcT9F5ixnUCYYZr1zGIve0r+ubp6tlzO9WoKbVD6c0LzAuahr/WT9ZFpwk="}
