{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2591,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:24:48.912949959Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"aa315e82-18ff-56c4-9a2b-d15648f8bf18","title":"[L222] Syntax healing has a 64 KiB repair ceiling and a 65,536-fragment argument ceiling","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L222.\n\n- Source: `crates/model/peritus-provider-core/src/healing.rs:20-21,88-105,108-129,137-179`; `healing/buffer.rs:28-49,57-76`; `healing/syntax.rs:3-45`.\n- Already-valid JSON retains the wider protocol bounds; **only malformed input considered for repair** is capped at **64 KiB**, with target at most **512 bytes**. Repair also rejects nesting beyond **64** and ambiguous/truncated containers, and permits only reversible quoting/trailing-comma/fence/prelude transformations. These integrity rules prevent fabricated values or tool authority; exceeding the arbitrary repair byte ceiling still produces a malformed-stream failure instead of typed unsupported repair or recoverable capacity.\n- ToolArgumentBuffer rejects after **65,536 nonempty fragments**, independently of aggregate bytes. Thus many tiny valid provider fragments can fail even when the argument is below its 16 MiB protocol cap. It buffers every original fragment boundary and emits a complete vector after close, preserving valid bytes or audited syntax repair.\n- Repair provenance stores both original and repaired content plus framing under the same canonical JSON bound; a narrow bound may admit the repaired value but reject its larger audit record. **All four implementation/test files fully read; no additional fragmentation or narrow-audit-bound test run.** No hidden elapsed retry/deadline is present here.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQG+ZjnsKw0eoPOtwqGDbtFtATnlB3d/IwivECjd+n+BeB51b8ujZdwca8+nx6ooX1P6hvyJbCppXOvY2Rf4lGAA="}
