ed projections from authoritative evidence. Update all producers, consumers and invariants together; a rejected new operation must leave the predecessor usable and already owned effects reconcilable.\n\nAcceptance and nonregression: long provider outages and Retry-After, split transport chunks and large streams, ambiguous acceptance and duplicate events, cancellation during recovery, adapter restart and route changes, proving same-thread reconnection and no duplicated accepted request/effect. Exercise the precise source-described failure path and the relevant byte/count/elapsed boundaries listed in this finding, plus ordinary small inputs. Check that legitimate work progresses after the former blocker while malformed input, conflicting identity, stale preimages and unauthorized scope still reject. Add fault injection at the affected acceptance/publication/recovery boundary and run the affected integration and formal checks on the final implementation. Source-derived risks remain distinct from executed reproductions; completion requires this evidence, not a promise that a plan alone cannot break anything.","created_at":"2026-10-06T13:24:48.544Z","kind":"decision"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBpwagrkREtWFf+cJ3lX9iCvQYrUxRbQHHDfojgvw/v2WwXrl4GFd2GgAQ7LhOYXTdIsuUan9qIE+GJHEXuPTQE="}
{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2601,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:24:48.935964141Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"db1ed7a5-217c-5e7f-9a74-a138bafeffae","title":"[L319] D0 commits dispatch intent before local capacity and ownership admission","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L319.\n\n- **Source:** `crates/orchestration/peritus-agent/src/runtime/driver/tool_steps.rs:137-153,156-200,255-289`; `src/runtime/tools.rs:394-419,584-600`; `src/reducer.rs:487-497,523-547` (remaining paths in the agent crate).\n- **Blocker:** dispatch_tool_once first commits ToolDispatched and increments pure active_tool_calls, then checks that a process-local coordinator exists and invokes its dispatch. The coordinator only then checks slot state, max_parallel, mutation serialization, and C4 authority. Definite pre-effect failures leave the durable slot Dispatched and the runtime slot AwaitingAuthorization.\n- **Consequence:** A valid batch whose pure concurrency ceiling permits a second call but whose runtime parallel allowance is one can commit its second dispatch intent and then receive DispatchCapacity before C4 executes anything. Retrying dispatch_tool_once fails because the pure slot is already Dispatched; record_tool_observation_once rejects the still-awaiting runtime slot. The available lost-tool classifier fabricates an Indeterminate outcome despite the known absence of this dispatch, and later prevents a clean gates/review completion. Missing runtime ownership after restore has the same admission order.\n- **Repair direction:** Perform effect-free local capacity/ownership admission before durable dispatch intent, retain the exact admitted dispatch capability, and durably classify definitely unstarted versus uncertain intent. Keep committed intent before actual external dispatch; do not remove serialization safeguards to repair the ordering.\n- **Evidence scope:** Source-derived capacity counterexample, with independently configurable pure and runtime ceilings. No dispatcher or journal fixture executed; installed DeveloperLoop use of this driver is not established.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNAY2jORmP0iEtDUSnGidgM4YBMCfBNBdLXDazm8h35YVlw+UQcw6tA51M23ucJFQlP+8xvGO0iRYtezQ1+q/A4="}
