ew operation must leave the predecessor usable and already owned effects reconcilable.\n\nAcceptance and nonregression: large and multi-file candidates, repeated valid repair cycles, changed candidate facts, delayed reviews, local/offline verification, restart mid-gate and cancellation, proving correct repair handoff without accepting a failed candidate or rereading unchanged evidence forever. Exercise the precise source-described failure path and the relevant byte/count/elapsed boundaries listed in this finding, plus ordinary small inputs. Check that legitimate work progresses after the former blocker while malformed input, conflicting identity, stale preimages and unauthorized scope still reject. Add fault injection at the affected acceptance/publication/recovery boundary and run the affected integration and formal checks on the final implementation. Source-derived risks remain distinct from executed reproductions; completion requires this evidence, not a promise that a plan alone cannot break anything.","created_at":"2026-10-06T13:24:48.544Z","kind":"decision"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQAKI0UxiuedL/hal9TViusjJBmTqgcx90ei5igDPvY7ULW8fZ6hcQahkz5Bwx3rsWCG+Ev1oUCY/1rQB1/gVbQo="}
{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2625,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:24:48.988860699Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"8a8cb683-ccfd-5be4-879c-7c112b172d40","title":"[L333] D1 per-result metadata and diagnostic limits reject or truncate at the domain boundary","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L333.\n\n- **Source:** `crates/orchestration/peritus-gates/src/outcome.rs:9-10,69-86,130-156,176-218`; `src/error.rs:75-94,144-153`.\n- **Limits:** Sixteen artifact references per normalized attempt result; decoded artifact metadata requires positive size, nonempty media type at most 255 bytes, nonempty label at most 256 bytes, and no control characters. Artifacts must be canonical with unique digests. GateError diagnostics truncate at a UTF-8 boundary after 4,096 bytes.\n- **Consequence:** A quality terminal above the artifact count fails normalization after the executor returns, before the result can become a durable observation. The limits protect individual representation size but supply no paging or artifact-manifest fallback here. Diagnostic truncation preserves the typed kind/recovery action and optional source, so it is not itself a work deadline.\n- **Repair direction:** Retain bounded metadata and trustworthy pass invariants with versioned manifests/paged references, preserving a durable outcome for effects already performed even when a view cannot fit.\n- **Evidence scope:** Complete result, error and engine execution reads. Larger valid C4 artifact terminals were not constructed in this audit; no test was run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQGlxn+x1Du7zFtkPdqrNwKDoqcqhiA3I2/XBdgU/8KkDynp83vRp/u9pgOXRhY+9Z0rGVSn2tnBWAaAbXcMSVAc="}
