{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2689,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:24:49.137704998Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"d2da3470-e795-5abc-b7d5-14f0290b75ab","title":"[L365] E1 materialization outbox delivery is limited to sixteen attempts without replenishment here","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L365.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/orchestration/peritus-harness/src/durability/commit.rs:27-28,263-275`, `src/aggregate/reducer/settlement.rs:88-97`, `src/durability/commit.rs:300-323`; C0 claim-attempt exhaustion previously completely read under L251.\n- Behavior: every materialization directive is created with an immutable positive outbox attempt maximum of 16. Reconciliation `Retry` changes the aggregate's delivery flag to Pending, but creates no new outbox draft or attempt amendment; only `PlanMaterialization` creates a directive. Failure/success/conflict settlement requires an exact claimed directive.\n- Consequence: repeated claim/recovery can exhaust delivery even when the aggregate continues to report pending/retryable work. This E1 commit API provides no mechanism to replenish an exhausted C0 row. Pending workspace exclusion and claim-required settlement can compound the blocker; external administrative recovery must be traced before claiming it is globally impossible. This is an attempt quota, not an execution-time deadline.\n- Repair direction: make retryable durable intent independent of finite transport claim counters. Preserve exact effect reconciliation while supporting indefinite backoff/redelivery and terminal operator controls. Runtime driver/outbox adapter behavior remains under review; no tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOmYNvqAYx/JJVprV2bav5EGKGkOPtd+5mUg4UBNXTVIgea37XM0vNKgIWS9rYklmbTo6PyQNDFlAo+9qHa/LQI="}
