jections from authoritative evidence. Update all producers, consumers and invariants together; a rejected new operation must leave the predecessor usable and already owned effects reconcilable.\n\nAcceptance and nonregression: valid boundary values and values just beyond each synthetic cap, final wrapper/receipt growth, non-ASCII strings, arbitrarily split frames/pages, malformed or conflicting data, mixed-version decode and save/reopen round trips. Exercise the precise source-described failure path and the relevant byte/count/elapsed boundaries listed in this finding, plus ordinary small inputs. Check that legitimate work progresses after the former blocker while malformed input, conflicting identity, stale preimages and unauthorized scope still reject. Add fault injection at the affected acceptance/publication/recovery boundary and run the affected integration and formal checks on the final implementation. Source-derived risks remain distinct from executed reproductions; completion requires this evidence, not a promise that a plan alone cannot break anything.","created_at":"2026-10-06T13:27:49.900Z","kind":"decision"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQAL9zSawONYbKQws1Jlj6JamRBrshssokwc63IZIRR95tfGNZgd0cx3SH5w5c4TlJOAu797qwLK71UK1tfvOwAc="}
{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2725,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:50.117031935Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"14797cf2-098a-56a5-ad97-31861b53dd90","title":"[L245] Presentation retention depends on exact config equality; latest-conversation recovery is one-shot","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L245.\n\n- Source: `crates/app/peritus-tui/src/runtime/state.rs`; `crates/app/peritus-tui/src/model/product/resume.rs:15-20,29-66,69-125`; `model/product/composer.rs:32-61`.\n- The retained Box<AppModel> is process-local and reused only if the entire TuiConfig is exactly equal. On retention it clears terminal state, prompts and candidate confirmation. A changed launch configuration discards the earlier presentation model. This is separate from durable daemon/native context identity; these files do not delete those contexts. Recovery of outstanding durable prompts must be traced through server replay/reissue, rather than assumed from retaining the client model.\n- `peritus resume` scans workspace-scoped library pages of **64**, including hidden items, and chooses the greatest activity_revision with no fixed page-count deadline. A missing capability, invalid next-page query, or query failure permanently clears the one-shot resume state for that model. The failure notice suggests starting a new conversation or invoking resume again; it does not retry discovery in place. Equal activity revisions preserve the first encountered candidate, so selection depends on page ordering when revisions tie.\n- Follow-up composition retains text while disconnected and requests an exact interaction binding before sending it. That is useful preservation, but not evidence of durable client draft storage across process exit. **All three implementation files fully read; server prompt replay and library ordering remain pending.**\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJNSqqNwpMd6elfB1s/YYO8cLhtl4SJQj3oCHwrxRyUvn1BmKqp8JLjczxbqNmC71+lDbC1z4nGoHiHiEQe3PQU="}
