{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2747,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:50.165218877Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"10e89cd7-7928-5a30-b3de-f220e4c16099","title":"[L260] Render scroll saturates at 65535 rows; an unterminated control string can hide later output","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L260.\n\n- Source: `crates/app/peritus-tui/src/render/product.rs:174-178,214-255`; `render.rs`; `sanitize.rs:47-107,149-167`.\n- Product inspection scroll limits saturate at **65535 rows**. Long wrapped raw diffs/reviews/previews cannot be traversed past that offset through this projection. Task summaries use **42 input bytes**, short IDs **12**, and event previews the separately chosen byte prefix (L243). inert_preview limits consumed source bytes, not escaped output bytes; nonprintable source bytes expand to four display characters.\n- Streaming TerminalSanitizer stays in OSC or String state until BEL/ST or ST respectively. An unterminated control string suppresses all subsequent stream content until such a terminator arrives; there is no explicit EOF reset/diagnostic in this complete sanitizer. This can produce apparent missing/stalled output even when bytes keep arriving. A new elapsed deadline would not repair the parser boundary; callers need an explicit stream/record ending contract and an inert indication of incomplete controls.\n- Conversational sanitization appropriately prevents source text from issuing active terminal controls. It must preserve that protection while making incomplete-state handling observable. **Root/product rendering and complete sanitizer including tests read; no runtime reproduction performed.**\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMPP1pHMvkzHiGROWCYej3N9xwZUQW0bIYRzGYbIELLCvSjDo+XVzU//ULJ/ZLD8GlrPhiB/yCmBnffjgBTkZQI="}
