jected new operation must leave the predecessor usable and already owned effects reconcilable.\n\nAcceptance and nonregression: valid boundary values and values just beyond each synthetic cap, final wrapper/receipt growth, non-ASCII strings, arbitrarily split frames/pages, malformed or conflicting data, mixed-version decode and save/reopen round trips. Exercise the precise source-described failure path and the relevant byte/count/elapsed boundaries listed in this finding, plus ordinary small inputs. Check that legitimate work progresses after the former blocker while malformed input, conflicting identity, stale preimages and unauthorized scope still reject. Add fault injection at the affected acceptance/publication/recovery boundary and run the affected integration and formal checks on the final implementation. Source-derived risks remain distinct from executed reproductions; completion requires this evidence, not a promise that a plan alone cannot break anything.","created_at":"2026-10-06T13:27:49.900Z","kind":"decision"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBccZTsJF4mLnHEO/Rehro6hwW+ImBCUlz5oODb1O8AAQ1NjQiJOFEg7FxnggCJFVdlNCS6+y4MTPaEktRtpDgI="}
{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2749,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:50.169462043Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"08799551-3ffc-5784-9207-dcc3c9e3c11f","title":"[L261] External file ranges still require reading a complete source capped at 64 MiB","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L261.\n\n- Source: `crates/app/peritus-tui/src/file_import.rs`; `image_import.rs`; attachment host bounds already recorded in L126/L154/L162.\n- Text import rejects an entire source above **64 MiB before range selection**, then reads the whole source into memory and hashes it. A small selected range from a larger log/data file is therefore unavailable. Selected text is limited to **256 KiB** and exact UTF-8 without binary controls; basename labels are **1..1024 bytes**. Line coordinates are u32 and the full source is scanned even for early ranges.\n- Image import requires a nonempty regular file at most **4 MiB**. The client checks bytes/size only; host image decoding/dimensions and aggregate attachment limits remain additional gates (L126/L162). These are transfer/source bounds, not inference/session time budgets.\n- Imports require an absolute path with no ParentDir component and perform no shell/path expansion. They reject a final symlink; Windows rejects device namespace and final reparse points; unsupported operating systems fail explicitly. Source/current-size checks and exact digests should remain, but selected-range access must not inherit an unrelated whole-file memory cap. **Both entire files and inline tests read; tests not run.**\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA