nd already owned effects reconcilable.\n\nAcceptance and nonregression: history beyond the reported count/byte boundaries, lock contention lasting beyond the old patience window, lost commit acknowledgements followed by later progress, torn uncommitted tails and true committed corruption, then reopen and resolve exact historical receipts. Exercise the precise source-described failure path and the relevant byte/count/elapsed boundaries listed in this finding, plus ordinary small inputs. Check that legitimate work progresses after the former blocker while malformed input, conflicting identity, stale preimages and unauthorized scope still reject. Add fault injection at the affected acceptance/publication/recovery boundary and run the affected integration and formal checks on the final implementation. Source-derived risks remain distinct from executed reproductions; completion requires this evidence, not a promise that a plan alone cannot break anything.","created_at":"2026-10-06T13:27:49.900Z","kind":"decision"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQAAtb7t5EZLmdSBXk/XqIhfVbXAY8pFYSf4rlELF8ogrNq+8Qod3jymjDXGzsWUMVXbDIny3iUUBOVDIDOzd4Q8="}
{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2753,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:50.178001601Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"aacf49eb-f81e-5169-8a71-f3ac4aa33fb0","title":"[L263] Preview rendering silently adds another scrollback cut; dashboard conversation shows only 12 activities","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L263.\n\n- Source: `crates/app/peritus-tui/src/render/product/preview.rs:63-101,293-309`; `render/product/detail.rs:281-314`; `terminal/transcript.rs` (L252).\n- Preview stdout and stderr are each run through a new **24×80 terminal emulator with 2048 scrollback lines** before rendering. This can discard additional earlier output after the host has already selected its retained tail. The “Earlier output omitted” notice depends only on the host's truncated flag, so it does not report this second display-side eviction.\n- The dashboard conversation selects only the last **12 activities**, then draws them without a conversation scroll offset in that panel. Long early activities within that group can occupy the visible panel while later ones lie below it; the dedicated conversation view is a separate access path. Raw review/diff fallback remains available, subject to host raw-text and u16 scroll limits already recorded.\n- These are display/accessibility boundaries, not evidence that the durable run/native context was deleted. **All product render implementation files fully read; renderer tests still pending; no execution performed.**\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAA