e all producers, consumers and invariants together; a rejected new operation must leave the predecessor usable and already owned effects reconcilable.\n\nAcceptance and nonregression: valid boundary values and values just beyond each synthetic cap, final wrapper/receipt growth, non-ASCII strings, arbitrarily split frames/pages, malformed or conflicting data, mixed-version decode and save/reopen round trips. Exercise the precise source-described failure path and the relevant byte/count/elapsed boundaries listed in this finding, plus ordinary small inputs. Check that legitimate work progresses after the former blocker while malformed input, conflicting identity, stale preimages and unauthorized scope still reject. Add fault injection at the affected acceptance/publication/recovery boundary and run the affected integration and formal checks on the final implementation. Source-derived risks remain distinct from executed reproductions; completion requires this evidence, not a promise that a plan alone cannot break anything.","created_at":"2026-10-06T13:27:49.900Z","kind":"decision"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBWomSmIc7g84fil/sj610M5q3qhuurW1oxn0pMbm3G5Vym1GQBxybauSLYYXIslgL1j3nqryB5KRrsXRqHq2Qw="}
{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2807,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:50.296998341Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"4f6c0760-4377-537a-bf05-534f069a8f82","title":"[L374] S1 delta packets require a completely fresh current snapshot","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L374.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/orchestration/peritus-run-knowledge/src/delta.rs:37-63`, `src/delta.rs:79-84`, `src/delta.rs:95-159`, `src/plan/evaluation.rs:71-97`, `src/delta/packet.rs:132-139`.\n- Behavior: packet planning first requires the current candidate to match exactly, computes invalidation for the entire current snapshot, and rejects the first non-reusable current section. It produces no partial packet for other fresh sections. This applies to every retained section, including navigation-only sections; classification as navigation happens only after whole-snapshot freshness succeeds. Source digests, candidate-sensitive kinds, lineage, and creation sequence drive freshness, rather than a wall-clock TTL.\n- Consequence: one stale retained optional section can prevent delivery of all refreshed authoritative facts/current references until a caller refreshes or removes it and constructs another snapshot. The snapshot API permits replacement, so this is an all-or-none packet contract, not proven permanent loss of context. Its effect on installed callers remains a separate trace question.\n- Repair direction: retain authoritative freshness checks while representing stale sections and pending refresh work explicitly. Permit a packet of fresh sections with a durable refresh frontier, and report which obligations cannot yet proceed. Never present stale navigation as evidence. No tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQE46gF1LWsnx0lWOg7juCoEtS9H/wLiNUo7CtCUVq5HWqPRV2vdxqt2HOzyiPvSMXS7IV9j5T7qPXtLWflks5AQ="}
