{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2809,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:50.301374845Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"010aa687-6485-5028-be5d-5834a5f93572","title":"[L375] S1 freshness and delta planning repeatedly scan complete canonical vectors","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L375.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/orchestration/peritus-run-knowledge/src/change.rs:93-131`, `src/plan/evaluation.rs:28-59`, `src/plan/evaluation.rs:107-139`, `src/plan/evaluation.rs:148-164`, `src/plan/evaluation.rs:173-224`, `src/plan.rs:217-246`, `src/delta.rs:79-84`, `src/delta.rs:55-63`, `src/delta.rs:260-278`, `src/delta.rs:287-321`.\n- Behavior: each bound source runs a fresh linear catalog lookup; each dependency scans the complete prior decision prefix, including reusable entries. With S sections and D dependencies per section this can require O(S squared times D) comparisons, reaching cubic section work for dense valid graphs. Every clarification target also scans the snapshot. Delta planning clones the current catalog, plans all current and prior sections, then performs separate linear prior-plan and prior-material lookups for each authoritative current section despite canonical IDs.\n- Consequence: pure synchronous planning has no paging, yield, cancellation, or persisted traversal frontier. Large caller-admissible knowledge graphs can consume substantial CPU and appear stalled; this is an unmeasured source-derived risk, not a demonstrated live loop or a synthetic timer. Fixed structural loop bounds are not arbitrary timeout policies.\n- Repair direction: merge canonical source/identity sets or build indexed lookups once, traverse actual dependency edges, and retain progress across host scheduling boundaries. Preserve exact digest and transitive invalidation semantics. No tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOMOyWdVjVILw1tb3KbuCg+46hnnQGOKiOdOj6706sS5eJTuUwiyPE9/bxm3xXqUDkyRgS3kXG8xhCRwZksQjAs="}
