ance and nonregression: valid boundary values and values just beyond each synthetic cap, final wrapper/receipt growth, non-ASCII strings, arbitrarily split frames/pages, malformed or conflicting data, mixed-version decode and save/reopen round trips. Exercise the precise source-described failure path and the relevant byte/count/elapsed boundaries listed in this finding, plus ordinary small inputs. Check that legitimate work progresses after the former blocker while malformed input, conflicting identity, stale preimages and unauthorized scope still reject. Add fault injection at the affected acceptance/publication/recovery boundary and run the affected integration and formal checks on the final implementation. Source-derived risks remain distinct from executed reproductions; completion requires this evidence, not a promise that a plan alone cannot break anything.","created_at":"2026-10-06T13:27:49.900Z","kind":"decision"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQAL+wY/7ZWoXacp8RgIbqYQpDP72pp7iD4ZTMWiw2Q8b0n94Kz/DsC+x0dig82yunoDjkqXZF0ylJFUk11vRXgQ="}
{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2843,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:50.378231087Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"84c5cd6b-7d43-52d8-afa6-be328e918d4d","title":"[L393] Acceptance completion policy requires finite u16 attempt and review-cycle ceilings","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L393.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/foundation/peritus-spec/src/policy.rs:8-58`, `src/contract.rs:17-30`, `src/contract.rs:42-93`, `src/contract/validation.rs:215-238`, `src/review.rs:122-193`, `tests/contract_validation.rs:11-66`, `tests/support/mod.rs:43-54`, `tests/support/mod.rs:124-126`.\n- Behavior: every CompletionPolicy contains mandatory positive u16 max_gate_attempts and max_review_cycles (1..65,535), with no Unlimited/None representation. It is frozen into every AcceptanceContract. Contract construction additionally rejects reviewer_quorum greater than max_review_cycles. Reviewer quorum is mandatory positive u16, while six reviewer-independence requirements and severity threshold are explicit caller choices. The type supplies getters/constructors, not an amendment or renewal operation on an existing contract.\n- Consequence: disabling the gate wall timeout does not disable these count ceilings. GateExecutionPlan explicitly supports optional timeout None (`src/gate.rs:66-79`); CompletionPolicy remains finite. The spec crate does not itself increment counts or settle a session: exhaustion behavior must be established in its quality-policy and execution consumers. Creating another contract or policy value is possible; the installed continuation/rebinding path is not established by these constructors. The tests enforce zero rejection and the quorum/cycle coupling. The test fixture 10,000-ms gate timeout and 2/4 completion counts are fixture data, not a newly discovered installed default.\n- Repair direction: distinguish optional user-selected attempt/cycle budgets from the machine integer representation, and preserve durable run/conversation identity when a budget is changed or renewed. Validate review quorum against the actual review scheduling model rather than assuming it is a cycle count. Keep required evidence and reviewer independence as acceptance semantics. No tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQPYnfh6tEsnaKHmtQ5kLmmjIp3Bw9PV65fxJw7Y9Lq3BpK2lmv9iwOW90thSEn6ah6kpyFEJeyGZ4LO5EqIlTws="}
