ublication and keep the old recovery root until adoption is durable. Rebuild derived projections from authoritative evidence. Update all producers, consumers and invariants together; a rejected new operation must leave the predecessor usable and already owned effects reconcilable.\n\nAcceptance and nonregression: renewal/adoption under the same authorized identity, revoked authority, stale epoch/revision, cross-scope requests, lost acknowledgements and restart, proving legitimate continuation without admitting unauthorized or duplicate effects. Exercise the precise source-described failure path and the relevant byte/count/elapsed boundaries listed in this finding, plus ordinary small inputs. Check that legitimate work progresses after the former blocker while malformed input, conflicting identity, stale preimages and unauthorized scope still reject. Add fault injection at the affected acceptance/publication/recovery boundary and run the affected integration and formal checks on the final implementation. Source-derived risks remain distinct from executed reproductions; completion requires this evidence, not a promise that a plan alone cannot break anything.","created_at":"2026-10-06T13:27:49.900Z","kind":"decision"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQEa4W18N4LEydzds+mX67zvxnhA80PduXrEGbz5kcB1uc64glgZJiYOGSHqFTY8M+NHgfEyHmfvKJvZDziQpsAc="}
{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2855,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:50.405306227Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"79b30baf-2287-5839-83f8-42339be656b6","title":"[L399] B2 acceptance construction and evaluation repeatedly scan collections without indexed lookup","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L399.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/foundation/peritus-quality-policy/src/evidence/reviews.rs:13-46`, `src/evidence/authority.rs:23-94`, `src/evaluator/reviews.rs:72-160`, `src/evaluator/gates.rs:10-29`, `src/evaluator/gates.rs:87-136`, `src/evaluator/gates.rs:175-228`, `src/evaluator/requirements.rs:10-59`, `src/evaluator/requirements.rs:88-111`, `src/evaluator/coverage.rs:10-52`, `src/evaluator/coverage.rs:98-234`, `src/evaluator/authority/lookup.rs:33-157`, `src/evaluator/authority/waiver.rs:17-67`, `src/evaluator/authority.rs:173-304`.\n- Behavior: construction detects repeated findings by scanning earlier reviews and repeated approval subjects by scanning earlier approvals; waiver consistency scans approvals again. Current review independence performs separate pairwise passes for actor and configured provenance dimensions. Gate and requirement evaluation repeatedly matches observations to definitions and scans observations again for each definition. Category coverage repeatedly crosses required categories and reviews. Authority validation repeatedly searches reviews/findings, approvals, waivers and artifacts instead of retaining indexed matches. Unexpected-approval checks scan the waiver list for each approval, with expensive waiver validation gated by matching finding/request; unique subjects limit matching validations, so this does not establish a general cubic approval-by-waiver-by-finding loop.\n- Consequence: these synchronous scans can grow quadratically across reviews/findings/approvals or as collection cross-products, adding CPU work before useful execution. The ghost/spec recursive models do not themselves execute; fixed-size identifier/digest comparisons also do not imply input-sized recursion. No runtime latency, stack failure, or installed incident was measured. Apart from the separately recorded ordinal limits, no additional vector-length quota is established here.\n- Repair direction: build validated indexes and cached current matches once, retain explicit semantic checks, and reuse them for coverage, independence and authority evaluation. Preserve canonical serialization independently from lookup layout. No tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNX3gTPcdE8XbfiI2cGYXeyL8UxNhsSCDQCU3Cgml5Zt6clzuXCxYdW5Mb+cK1/aGI+vlY0oD2mptBoHxe24RQw="}
