{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2857,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:50.409788688Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"f8b350ca-faa5-51ac-9bae-6b0127f25026","title":"[L400] B0 session aggregate cannot advance its revision or acceptance-contract binding","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L400.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/foundation/peritus-kernel/src/aggregate.rs:20-37`, `src/aggregate.rs:138-190`, `src/command.rs:16-103`, `src/reducer.rs:148-160`, `src/reducer.rs:203-246`, `src/reducer.rs:305-322`, `src/aggregate/validation.rs:9-46`, `tests/adversarial.rs:13-47`.\n- Behavior: genesis fixes the session aggregate's exact seven-component revision and contract ID/digest. Every command must use that revision and contract; every run must match it. The complete command vocabulary has no revision/contract amendment, rebinding or successor transition, and reduction explicitly preserves the original revision. Creating another aggregate is possible through open(), but no in-place continuation across a workspace revision, harness, policy or provider-profile change exists here.\n- Consequence: an ordinary candidate revision or authorized policy/contract update cannot be represented as advancement of this aggregate. A caller must manage a new aggregate and its continuity externally. This does not prove that a new model context or session identity is required: open() accepts caller-supplied identities, and this effect-free crate does not own persistence or provider contexts. Reusing stale revision facts to evade freshness is not a valid repair.\n- Repair direction: model durable session identity separately from versioned run authority, with an explicit checked revision/contract successor transition that preserves history, invalidates only affected current evidence, and retains resumable work/context bindings. No tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJ2Mq2YCOKVwWqvfsayZ/P/YWfijTatvcAoHkjjwyRnEKlUf+AFEIo3xpUnJ0l8ljhHEmfGuTrbv51w90kfSnQc="}
