{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2859,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:50.414684356Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"6aaf1725-5e97-57b2-a30c-fcb8ee235c4a","title":"[L401] B0 counts all review requests against an immutable run-lifetime review allowance","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L401.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/foundation/peritus-kernel/src/reducer/review.rs:35-73`, `src/reducer/review.rs:93-107`, `src/reducer/attempt.rs:97-120`, `src/reducer.rs:317-322`, `src/aggregate.rs:225-238`, `crates/foundation/peritus-spec/src/policy.rs` (previous complete read; L393/L395).\n- Behavior: RequestReview counts every stored review whose run ID matches, without excluding requested, active, submitted or invalidated cycles, then rejects once that count reaches CompletionPolicy.max_review_cycles. Invalidating a review changes its phase but does not release the count. Fixer resumption and replacement attempts do not reset the run-wide count. The contract is immutable in this aggregate; the rejection is generic IllegalPhase rather than a distinct allowance-exhaustion result.\n- Consequence: abandoned/invalidated review requests consume the same finite allowance as completed review work, so repeated normal iteration can permanently block further review for the run. One stored review request consumes one unit regardless of how an external orchestrator groups concurrent reviewers. No wall timer is involved; installed contract values/caller behavior are not established by these files.\n- Repair direction: represent review progress, cancellation, invalidation and renewable user-governed resource policy separately. Remove a mandatory iteration cutoff for ordinary driving; if an explicitly authorized quota applies, expose its reason and a durable continuation/amendment path. No tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHGauzo8aAl794LQVez2n7ywxZmLAlIA41ZoIDzTfNDM13OpjQu3yDUxt++5xEzwCkayDI0/53+a78JoUx/TRA8="}
