ion must leave the predecessor usable and already owned effects reconcilable.\n\nAcceptance and nonregression: large and multi-file candidates, repeated valid repair cycles, changed candidate facts, delayed reviews, local/offline verification, restart mid-gate and cancellation, proving correct repair handoff without accepting a failed candidate or rereading unchanged evidence forever. Exercise the precise source-described failure path and the relevant byte/count/elapsed boundaries listed in this finding, plus ordinary small inputs. Check that legitimate work progresses after the former blocker while malformed input, conflicting identity, stale preimages and unauthorized scope still reject. Add fault injection at the affected acceptance/publication/recovery boundary and run the affected integration and formal checks on the final implementation. Source-derived risks remain distinct from executed reproductions; completion requires this evidence, not a promise that a plan alone cannot break anything.","created_at":"2026-10-06T13:27:49.900Z","kind":"decision"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQGtXzg01dnuMPC+wecANSUqTum4OeazaN5mOD0gFQvmF3CrO6cERVlDVEW8SMt07qO987upQC/SisCUHST7ZcQI="}
{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2891,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:50.490380676Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"7e126ca5-efde-5572-9f6e-74869d8b6253","title":"[L424] E2 complete-report caps make long or recurrent evidence unanalyzable without lossless partitioning","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L424.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/analysis/peritus-debugger/src/clustering/engine.rs:146-249`, `src/causal/analyzer.rs:112-138,223-264`, `src/causal/rules.rs:141-148`, `src/report/validation.rs:159-187,210-273,299-326` in the same crate; compiled values are in L415.\n- Behavior: Clustering first builds all exact groups, then merges groups having the same pattern kind/category/analyzer/component class, regardless of environment or revision. Only afterward it checks each merged group against 4,096 members and the whole set against 8,192 patterns. Every mapped diagnostic cause retains every task-success citation in its subject as contrary evidence; complete report validation then rejects a cause with more than 256 contrary citations. Causes and report claims are separately capped at 16,384, component links at 32,768, and full report bytes at 64 MiB after encoding. Any excess returns an error for the entire result.\n- Consequence: For inputs producing 4,097 distinct findings that merge into one pattern, clustering fails even though the selection's 131,072-event ceiling permits that scale. A diagnostic within a subject having 257 successful observations can likewise make the complete report fail through contrary evidence. These are source-derived conditional examples, not constructed/executed fixtures or proof of installed daily-driver usage. Analysis failure does not erase source evidence, but there is no lossless paged report alternative in these functions.\n- Repair direction: Preserve every citation in durable indexed evidence and represent large patterns/reports with lossless partitions and continuation cursors. Distinguish a display/work-page bound from rejection of the complete diagnosis. No tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQEPmhrf2giFbrgn7edkxwvfKWumG7VLcUfQ0LUZq/sxLFqThm9mdjdWzHZUOETBd+9y+f73O5EqbZ12PWv9vpgo="}
