{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2919,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:50.560330686Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"f6a908ad-1218-5d0e-8b2c-4c13f0b31d66","title":"[L439] E3 bootstrap analysis performs every resample synchronously with no durable cursor or cancellation","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L439.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/analysis/peritus-eval/src/statistics/paired.rs:189-245,248-284`, `src/report/analysis.rs:72-122,245-306`, `src/limits.rs:13-24`, `src/aggregate/reducer.rs:285-293` in the same crate.\n- Behavior: Bootstrap allocates one result per replicate and, for every task in every replicate, allocates a new preimage and computes SHA-256. It then sorts the complete result vector. The normal frozen policy allows up to 100,000 replicates over up to 2,048 selected tasks. The statistical functions are synchronous and have no cancellation/progress parameter, checkpoint cursor or resumable partial result. Public compare_paired requires only a positive replicate count rather than checking EvaluationLimits itself.\n- Consequence: An admitted maximum-size campaign can require 204.8 million hash/draw iterations in one analysis call before a result is returned, while durable campaign cancellation is forbidden during Analyzing (L433). A process restart recomputes analysis rather than resuming a saved replicate cursor. This is a counted loop bound, not a measured runtime or proof of the live writer's stall. Statistical confidence and probability bounds are mathematical preconditions, not execution deadlines.\n- Repair direction: Preserve deterministic seed/draw identity while processing resamples in cancellable, durable batches. Expose progress and resumable state; make requested statistical workload explicit instead of relying on a compulsory compiled ceiling to contain blocking computation. No tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQDJXZ/3YHIS7OD4LpwIB5aQW7KI2c2SYrmBbKo2Io/liEMsGWnkFrJdtoawC+0vPpovOqYCBljZTHmLpc/p8Ngk="}
