ew operation must leave the predecessor usable and already owned effects reconcilable.\n\nAcceptance and nonregression: large and multi-file candidates, repeated valid repair cycles, changed candidate facts, delayed reviews, local/offline verification, restart mid-gate and cancellation, proving correct repair handoff without accepting a failed candidate or rereading unchanged evidence forever. Exercise the precise source-described failure path and the relevant byte/count/elapsed boundaries listed in this finding, plus ordinary small inputs. Check that legitimate work progresses after the former blocker while malformed input, conflicting identity, stale preimages and unauthorized scope still reject. Add fault injection at the affected acceptance/publication/recovery boundary and run the affected integration and formal checks on the final implementation. Source-derived risks remain distinct from executed reproductions; completion requires this evidence, not a promise that a plan alone cannot break anything.","created_at":"2026-10-06T13:27:49.900Z","kind":"decision"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOkOc10/XDNYcaHoYeQEPeL99dE06HZ2YS1jiC821rKYIQWSUuA13iCzb4mRWQH6uXCMjWr7drhed1edA37n6QE="}
{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2921,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:50.565054839Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"f5438636-fc2a-59cd-ab34-e1c93983d213","title":"[L441] E3 can publish analysis/report bindings that F0 later rejects with no in-place campaign repair","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L441.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/analysis/peritus-eval/src/aggregate/reducer.rs:349-365`, `src/runtime/artifact.rs:125-152`, `src/runtime/publication.rs:60-101` in that crate; `crates/analysis/peritus-evolution/src/binding/evaluation/evidence.rs:54-75`; `crates/analysis/peritus-eval/tests/publication_integration.rs:222-245`.\n- Behavior: CompleteAnalysis stores a caller-supplied analysis digest/artifact. commit_report_ready requires some analysis digest but never compares it with the validated report's analysis digest, dataset digest or plan binding. The downstream F0 PublishedEvaluationEvidence capture requires those exact equalities. E3 terminal state refuses subsequent commands; the closed command vocabulary contains no report/analysis correction operation. The positive publication integration fixture commits SHA-256 of the literal analysis artifact rather than binding the semantic EvaluationAnalysis digest.\n- Consequence: E3's successful publication is weaker than F0's evidence admission contract. A mismatched report can become permanently Published for that campaign and then fail when used for evolution, forcing reconciliation or a successor instead of correcting the same campaign. The fixture shows the missing comparison in exercised source paths; this audit did not execute it or measure the actual digest values. F0's exact evidence checks are required integrity checks and should remain.\n- Repair direction: Validate one complete analysis/report/dataset/plan contract before CompleteReport and publication. Retain repairable intent and provide an explicit reconciled successor linked to the same logical work when previously published bindings cannot be amended safely. No tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHfxqW8hjh4uQWvRrXCdvD2wFqvhoYfa2kL38Nqlt4m2UEmHW73tFbPdB5kZAj2g9DdQtg09A7ADNDBwGAp4DAU="}
