{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2935,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:50.597593691Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"47962aa0-f4a9-5727-8983-9e77e6c9c18c","title":"[L448] F0 promotion always requires resource measurements, even with unconstrained thresholds and unrelated objectives","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L448.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/analysis/peritus-evolution/src/selection/engine.rs:39-46,52-153`, `src/binding/policy.rs:53-111`, `src/selection/tests.rs`, `src/qualification/evidence.rs:189-208` in the same crate.\n- Behavior: Assessment always creates fourteen mandatory criteria. Latency, cost, input tokens and output tokens each require an available measurement and satisfaction of its u64 ceiling. Choosing other ranking objectives or setting a ceiling to u64::MAX does not disable that availability prerequisite. Trace/teardown requirements have explicit optional flags; resource measurements do not. The qualification fixture supplies every metric.\n- Consequence: An evaluation with legitimately unavailable provider cost or token measurements cannot promote a candidate through F0, even when the caller intended no constraint on that metric. Additional correctness evidence does not remove the unavailable criterion. These are frozen quality-policy prerequisites, not elapsed-time enforcement; the blocker is lack of a representable optional requirement and capability validation. This audit did not run a provider evaluation.\n- Repair direction: Distinguish required measurements, optional measurements and ranking objectives in the policy. Validate required measurement capability before admitting a campaign; preserve unavailable values honestly rather than inventing passing observations. No tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCWdYG5MII88DeSkSll9mM1rjWxUEl976H1+ZD+bQ9ggZ31p3jhgmiF2yuJOOKOedLC8nksLLfRbMb1jadKfcQA="}
