{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2943,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:50.616068096Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"3a255e3e-d14e-5104-811c-823bd7ce40eb","title":"[L452] F0's accepted bounds disagree with its attribution and assessment persistence schema","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L452.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/analysis/peritus-evolution/src/limits.rs:22-33,63-94`, `src/attribution/record.rs:124-135`, `src/wire/semantic/attribution.rs:22-29`, `src/selection/engine.rs:52-153`, `src/campaign/reducer/transition.rs:160-183`, `src/wire/semantic/selection.rs:42-45`, `src/wire/semantic/state/campaign.rs:95-98` in that crate; codec collection ceiling documented in L009.\n- Behavior: Attribution permits 65,536 entries, but its single canonical collection uses the codec's 65,535 maximum. EvolutionLimits also accepts criteria=1 through 13. Assessment always produces fourteen results and campaign admission does not compare that count with the frozen criteria limit. Complete-state decoding does require all fourteen and a limit of at least fourteen.\n- Consequence: The advertised maximum attribution cannot be serialized. A campaign with a small accepted criteria limit can admit and encode an assessment that its own checkpoint decoder rejects during recovery. These are source-derived boundary cases; no fixture was constructed or executed in this audit.\n- Repair direction: Make admission, serialization and restore share one representability contract. Remove meaningless tunable criteria counts for a fixed schema, and page attribution independently of workload size rather than exposing incompatible maxima. No tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQGCsTFaO/HEy3mlRUPsx6BrgtRKcBtyTCEmZb98Y7u+SLXeH3woHN3HZ8MWVAIC28ulboTEq4Yb4MZE9oCpTCwc="}
