{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2953,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:50.639520907Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"bd02249d-6cf2-552a-b03f-36fdf19c8a6c","title":"[L458] C5 JSON has non-widenable depth/member ceilings checked after full parsing","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L458.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/model/peritus-model-protocol/src/schema.rs:23-72,95-110,210-245,272-289,292-329`, `src/json_duplicates.rs:5-8,32-49,62-76` in the same crate.\n- Behavior: Both schema and structured-value JsonBounds hard-code depth=64 and aggregate members=65,536; public construction permits only positive tightening. Byte and string ceilings derive from ProtocolLimits. Parsing first constructs the complete serde JSON tree, then recursively scans the source again to detect duplicate keys, then checks domain depth/member/string limits and produces another canonical byte buffer. Object canonicalization collects/sorts all keys. Schemas reject nonlocal references.\n- Consequence: Valid larger local structures cannot be represented even within the provider's capacity. A tight member/depth setting does not bound initial parse/allocation to that selected setting; total input bytes and library parser behavior still constrain the work. This is a source-derived resource/acceptance limit, not a wall timeout or measured stall. Duplicate rejection and preventing ambient remote-reference fetches are integrity/authority requirements.\n- Repair direction: Validate chosen structural bounds during parsing, preserve duplicate rejection, and separate provider/schema representability from bounded working memory. Support references or paging without introducing ambient file/network authority. No tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNxLeAjAj/vVN47casmIxDRFOXHSLLvzQnT466YkpNYYwXZXhx2xpJrLvqHX+5SQrSq3c1lMNyUP1faALY1UNQo="}
