{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2955,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:50.644103560Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"57785649-492e-547f-ab14-2e38cb174103","title":"[L459] C5's complete request constructor admits unsatisfiable tool selection and unsupported semantic continuation","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L459.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/model/peritus-model-protocol/src/tool.rs:51-62`, `src/request/model.rs:38-73`, `src/request/validation.rs:11-32,70-146`, `src/request/options.rs:70-104`, `src/capability/profile.rs:160-169` in the same crate.\n- Behavior: ModelRequest stores ToolChoice but never passes it into request validation. Required with no tool definitions, or Specific naming an absent tool, is therefore accepted. Continuation without a sequence is semantic; validation requires ResumableResponse only for exact cursors and never checks the profile's ResumeKind for semantic continuation. Required capability negotiation does not fill these cross-field gaps.\n- Consequence: A caller can freeze a request whose stated tool requirement has no possible declared fulfillment, or one whose continuation contradicts an explicitly Unsupported profile. Actual transport may reject or omit such options; adapter behavior remains individually audited. This is a source-derived admission trap, not permission to fabricate continuation support or bypass tool authority.\n- Repair direction: Validate selection against the admitted declaration set and validate continuation strength against the exact profile contract before submitting. Return actionable unsupported-capability information while preserving the logical conversation and prior work. No tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQP6BmZRXojSUs5zM7e3ywHfZAsbo7Xq/lfrt0Ik2CflGl7XT9dUneD63wZOQxScGzw/PI1e6F3kK3eLyW4KN2gg="}
