{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2971,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:50.681656051Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"5cf7054b-2e6d-58aa-8829-2e9a55f006e1","title":"[L467] Optional hosted metadata enrichment blocks return of an already fetched model catalog","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L467.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/model/peritus-provider-core/src/hosted/catalog.rs:31-52,55-79`, `src/hosted.rs:135-139`, `tests/model_catalog.rs:88-112` in the same crate.\n- Behavior: after successfully retrieving the selected service's authenticated model inventory, mixed-protocol OpenCode services synchronously await a separate unauthenticated metadata HTTP request before returning any model. Failure is intentionally tolerated, but there is no partial publication while that optional request is pending. The metadata body has an additional fixed 16-MiB cap. Explicit caller cancellation is checked during transport/body consumption and before return.\n- Consequence: an optional stalled enrichment endpoint can hold model discovery pending even though the authoritative inventory already succeeded. This does not justify reintroducing a synthetic timeout: lack of incremental publication is the lifecycle issue. Tests inspect ordinary metadata failure, not an indefinitely pending enrichment fetch. No live stall reproduced.\n- Repair direction: publish exact discovered IDs with unknown capabilities first, enrich asynchronously with owned cancellation/progress, and require reviewed capability evidence only for the chosen invocation. Keep credential-origin separation and the prohibition on invented fallback models. No tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQPud0fv+z7UVosIo9q9bK47NLGUiqSFCoF7Vhj8YqrUjKDryECyK6nmGwXqbNCKkUCzFuTeCFd3IwH/ZckgBFgo="}
