ng provider outages and Retry-After, split transport chunks and large streams, ambiguous acceptance and duplicate events, cancellation during recovery, adapter restart and route changes, proving same-thread reconnection and no duplicated accepted request/effect. Exercise the precise source-described failure path and the relevant byte/count/elapsed boundaries listed in this finding, plus ordinary small inputs. Check that legitimate work progresses after the former blocker while malformed input, conflicting identity, stale preimages and unauthorized scope still reject. Add fault injection at the affected acceptance/publication/recovery boundary and run the affected integration and formal checks on the final implementation. Source-derived risks remain distinct from executed reproductions; completion requires this evidence, not a promise that a plan alone cannot break anything.","created_at":"2026-10-06T13:27:49.900Z","kind":"decision"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQKqtVxLLVFgCfQgZNtISgLc0xhEDGbUgf2VyWjEL7IWiaZ+PE35nDEsN3h4e5ksffclGEN2Mfmq/3B6gtUZbLwQ="}
{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2979,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:50.699995212Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"5999ad18-6462-5ec9-99ed-1a2546095f55","title":"[L471] Compatible profiles exclude all provider-side continuation and several unused capabilities","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L471.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/model/peritus-provider-compatible/src/profile.rs:224-257,260-271`, `src/request/validation.rs:15-45`, `src/request.rs:29-37`, `src/request/responses.rs:21-24` in the same crate.\n- Behavior: every compatible profile must use stateless replay, Unsupported resume, best-effort local cancellation, provider-enforced output and declared streaming. Any Unknown capability anywhere in the profile is rejected, as is any supported capability without a mapped implementation even if the current request does not use it. Requests reject every continuation, storage/background setting, cache setting, reasoning control, audio/document and unresolved media. Only Draft202012 schemas are accepted; a parallel-call count narrower than the negotiated count is rejected because the wire maps a boolean only. Responses additionally rejects seed/stops.\n- Consequence: this adapter cannot reconnect an interrupted provider response at an exact cursor. Persistent local conversation replay is still possible; stateless provider invocation alone does not mean that the local session is ephemeral. Availability depends on the exact adapter contract, and removing these checks alone cannot invent provider resume guarantees. Whole-profile unknown rejection can prevent a supported basic request until its profile is normalized.\n- Repair direction: preserve exact local history and unresolved invocation identity independently of provider state; represent supported capabilities and their required operations per invocation. Add reviewed provider-side resume implementations where available, and retain explicit unsupported recovery rather than silently replacing the context. No tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMktgJzvefs7wfoOH7c9e3F9TY0lYWdYAqrfbwuJcXbAawMvU4S7VZTCSYB1eKclxgQXXnWfh/th3L135/tzkwE="}
