{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":2999,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:50.745185728Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"1bd2df76-6aa4-5dff-8223-eacee95824e2","title":"[L482] Anthropic streaming has a fixed 4096-entry deduplication ceiling and derived identities can exceed the protocol width","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L482.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/model/peritus-provider-anthropic/src/stream/state.rs:128-188`, `src/stream/value.rs:35-40`, `src/stream/content.rs:95-104`, `src/stream/content.rs:130-148`, `src/stream/content.rs:178-218` in the same crate; the fully read C5 identity and production limit definitions are covered by L017/L457.\n- Behavior: every new SSE id-and-digest pair is retained for the whole response; entry 4097 fails, with no eviction or configurable bound. Different payloads with the same id create separate entries. Derived item ids append a colon and decimal block index to a response id accepted at the same maximum width. Content, tool-buffer and reasoning-fragment constructors hardcode production protocol limits; replay wrappers are serialized before fragment admission.\n- Consequence: an otherwise valid long response with enough identified events fails because of a compiled local count. A response id near the accepted width can fail only when its first item is normalized. Independent fragment/wrapper ceilings and synchronous whole allocations remain after elapsed deadlines are removed. No live provider boundary or installed-run reproduction is claimed.\n- Repair direction: retain bounded deduplication with an explicit replay horizon or durable index, make identity derivation fit by construction, and thread one negotiated resource policy through framing, normalization, replay and reduction. Keep capacity handling recoverable without replacing it with another arbitrary timer. No tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQGwlXZUIXRVMfewUuxCjA7U7B8htkJOf98Wwf7bH//nM4STX49lDLFvohAFV5MCrKu/srQhWgMFdO4kruK39KQU="}
