{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3007,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:50.768968946Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"1dc0bfdb-78d7-546d-b4b8-ea76ae419742","title":"[L487] Google request projection omits parallel policy and repeatedly scans the whole transcript for tool results","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L487.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/model/peritus-provider-google/src/request.rs:41-63`, `src/request/generate.rs:14-45`, `src/request/generate.rs:87-98`, `src/request/interactions.rs:14-52`, `src/request/content.rs:45-65` in the same crate.\n- Behavior: neither dialect projects the request parallel-tool policy or passes it to stream normalization. Generate omits tool choice entirely when no definitions exist. Required/specific selection is not checked against definitions in these mappings. Interactions always requires non-system input even with stored continuation, and model path syntax is imposed on both dialects. Each Generate tool result searches every message/content block in reverse for its call name, independently of the result position.\n- Consequence: accepted protocol choices can lose intended semantics or fail only downstream. Growing tool history produces O(results times transcript blocks) synchronous mapping work, and matching can consider later entries rather than a preceding-call index. Unsupported contract controls are distinct from provider capacity and local session persistence; no live duplicate-id history is claimed.\n- Repair direction: validate selected controls against exact mapping/enforcement before submission, index preceding calls once while traversing history, and make large transcript projection cancellable/resumable. No tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMEMMkrM/pJ509J+2FBF61jEKCSBCLWUv4xx4Qs1fQzsn1MfvQ6zfSB1cOzghmm4in2xEaUrLRXQFDYsi8W9Hgs="}
