{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3009,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:50.774268640Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"10ade4b6-ba15-564a-9c94-3fc5c50adf29","title":"[L488] Google HTTP recovery drains complete rejected bodies and can lose typed failures behind retry-policy errors","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L488.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/model/peritus-provider-google/src/client.rs:65-171`, `src/client.rs:176-188`, `src/client.rs:280-358` in the same crate; provider-core retry limits are covered by L207/L228.\n- Behavior: each submission clones the full encoded request and accumulates bytes, but policy admission occurs only after failure. For non-200 status the adapter waits until body EOF, then classifies quota/status and plans retry. Retry-After accepts unsigned decimal seconds with at most three fractional digits; invalid/date forms disappear. A retained delay outside the configured policy can return an error before the constructed typed failure is published.\n- Consequence: a stalled error body delays decisive failure/recovery without a timer, while optional delay parsing or policy failure can obscure the original status. Raising deadlines does not resolve these ownership/state gaps; fixed finite caller policies still limit attempts/elapsed/bytes. This audit does not identify the currently installed Google policy or claim a measured stalled connection.\n- Repair direction: make header-derived failure state observable immediately, gather bounded optional body facts without blocking ownership transfer, admit retries before resubmission, and preserve failure identity when delay policy stops work. No tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQK4H30U3JmT+Qty05jC1kW3n7Eu4rvttCGtbFIOKx2qzygWKna1XRxAelCSj+7e5d1PNEBY88Grn/bMCQHA9CQc="}
