{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3013,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:50.785509733Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"9086c803-dbc7-56a8-8635-359ba41bc942","title":"[L490] Google thought replay can concatenate complete JSON objects and thought summaries silently drop later array entries","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L490.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/model/peritus-provider-google/src/stream/interactions.rs:221-247`, `src/stream/generate.rs:218-256`, `src/stream/generate.rs:270-294`, `src/stream/interaction_fields.rs:8-20`, `src/request/content.rs:97-118`, `src/request/content.rs:182-200`; `crates/model/peritus-model-protocol/src/reducer/events.rs:131-143`, `src/reducer/terminal.rs:39-53`.\n- Behavior: every signature event is serialized as a complete JSON object and emitted as replay bytes for the current reasoning item; repeated signatures do not replace/merge/close that item. The reducer concatenates bytes and accepts opaque replay at item closure. Both request mappings later parse that replay as one JSON object. Thought summary content arrays return only the first text member, ignoring subsequent members.\n- Consequence: multiple admitted signature objects for one item yield invalid next-request JSON, so a completed response can poison continuation replay. Summaries can lose text without a rejection. This is an input-condition proof from source, not a claim about currently emitted live provider signatures.\n- Repair direction: define one canonical completed replay object per reasoning item, retain explicit signature boundaries/identity, and normalize all supported summary members. Qualify normalized output through reduction and next-request encoding. No tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOQrPh6EUtrkmpMqzuLfw4nb9Ch+sdPfavbFG+qKuuu7/Qhq9CgsOuXrJismUop0ysInzZCeyTlmx7M7gLMzPwQ="}
