{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3015,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:50.791149459Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"13c2a17b-0635-576b-a28d-ce39300f3c10","title":"[L491] Google structured output and tool arguments share fixed buffering and fragment-count limits, delaying semantic progress until closure","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L491.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/model/peritus-provider-google/src/stream/generate.rs:229-244`, `src/stream/generate.rs:340-355`, `src/stream/interactions.rs:200-219`, `src/stream/interactions.rs:263-296`, `src/stream/value.rs:46-68`; `crates/model/peritus-provider-core/src/healing/buffer.rs:28-76`.\n- Behavior: structured text and Interactions tool input use ToolArgumentBuffer with hardcoded production limits: nonempty fragments, 8-MiB event bytes, 65536 fragment boundaries and 16-MiB accumulated argument bytes. They emit heartbeats while accumulating; validated/healed semantic output is produced only on item/step closure. Completion parses the whole JSON and constructs an entire event vector, copying original fragments. General output allowance is separately 256 MiB, with additional typed text/JSON bounds at reduction.\n- Consequence: whole-output capacity does not override the smaller internal buffer or fragment-count ceiling. The client can appear active while semantic content is withheld, and large completion work is synchronous without a cancellation/progress cursor. Empty provider text parts also fail fragment admission. No benchmark or installed-run reproduction is claimed.\n- Repair direction: give structured and tool buffers explicit negotiated policies, preserve accountable streaming progress before authorization, stream validated completion output, and handle capacity as resumable state rather than a timer-driven abort. No tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQByZXIXPY+wPTboI1YZNsWpbbRWOcVlhi5in1g6j4y/Xw25o49vwk1YzJYMKpIMW+EmUp/NMiZmlF64s7bk7nAs="}
