{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3039,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:50.851528770Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"658846ae-4f57-579e-9b86-183e9df3cc76","title":"[L506] Plugin SDK requires finite deadlines and lifetime request quotas","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L506.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/extensions/peritus-plugin-sdk/src/manifest.rs:194-247,349-391`; `src/protocol.rs:22-38,40-86`; `src/protocol/request_wire.rs:25-37`; `tests/contracts.rs:41-47,93-104` in the same crate.\n- Behavior: every plugin manifest must provide six positive quotas: concurrent requests (u16), frame bytes (u32), output bytes (u64), invocation milliseconds (u64), lifecycle requests (u64), and allowed protocol violations (u16). Zero is invalid and there is no unlimited/absent variant. Host narrowing takes the minimum of each quota. Invocation context additionally requires a numeric deadline_millis; there is no deadline-free wire representation. The manifest schema and current protocol support are version one.\n- Consequence: a plugin cannot express an untimed invocation or an indefinitely reusable lifecycle within this contract. Removing a Tokio timeout at a caller alone cannot eliminate the compulsory SDK deadline/lifetime semantics. The 30 s/1000-request values in SDK tests are fixture values, not yet evidence of host production defaults.\n- Repair direction: migrate manifests, wire context, host mediation, and lifecycle accounting together to explicit optional deadline/unlimited or replenishable policy semantics; reserve resource bounds for explicit operation/capacity constraints rather than mandatory session exhaustion. Host enforcement is inspected separately. No tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQD200MTaPHBx0mpGZyQTorQVQoYMerYQf34natdcPzKvgIyiiKVOAEarzspymLg676BIIj/CAbP2DbVJschKOwM="}
