ptance and nonregression: valid boundary values and values just beyond each synthetic cap, final wrapper/receipt growth, non-ASCII strings, arbitrarily split frames/pages, malformed or conflicting data, mixed-version decode and save/reopen round trips. Exercise the precise source-described failure path and the relevant byte/count/elapsed boundaries listed in this finding, plus ordinary small inputs. Check that legitimate work progresses after the former blocker while malformed input, conflicting identity, stale preimages and unauthorized scope still reject. Add fault injection at the affected acceptance/publication/recovery boundary and run the affected integration and formal checks on the final implementation. Source-derived risks remain distinct from executed reproductions; completion requires this evidence, not a promise that a plan alone cannot break anything.","created_at":"2026-10-06T13:27:49.900Z","kind":"decision"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQD2e8MV+T/+Ifx0BX54v+LJu+PWvb+JpQQp7UbKwJ0K18Jy0zFglfBPC9t8aL8E8Mio39tpfTFW/aGIcFeIDpQA="}
{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3053,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:50.883850788Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"43ae8ba0-4ce3-5ba6-8bd0-2a8b8534e217","title":"[L513] Plugin diagnostic truncation can panic the host","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L513.\n\n- Source: `crates/extensions/peritus-plugin-host/src/error.rs:82-90`; `src/host.rs:230-240` in the same crate.\n- Host errors truncate diagnostic strings at byte **1,024** without checking UTF-8 boundaries, including mediated denial details. A diagnostic crossing that boundary inside a multibyte character can panic instead of returning the original failure.\n- Daily-driving consequence: rendering an otherwise reportable plugin failure can interrupt its host and obscure the original cause.\n- Repair direction: use Unicode-safe bounded rendering and retain the complete failure through an accessible diagnostic artifact. Source-confirmed; no runtime reproduction performed.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCIsCW4DEcWwK11FxO6VZ0EmjIz5nCf5u7TyVcor3md2NWqxj70q3rmrPstYOUFldLq/zkhgrzAjOah3vZbG3gg="}
