d many-path capture/restore, divergent preimage rejection, interrupted staging/publication/restore, then reopen and continue the same conversation with an exact restored workspace. Exercise the precise source-described failure path and the relevant byte/count/elapsed boundaries listed in this finding, plus ordinary small inputs. Check that legitimate work progresses after the former blocker while malformed input, conflicting identity, stale preimages and unauthorized scope still reject. Add fault injection at the affected acceptance/publication/recovery boundary and run the affected integration and formal checks on the final implementation. Source-derived risks remain distinct from executed reproductions; completion requires this evidence, not a promise that a plan alone cannot break anything.","created_at":"2026-10-06T13:27:49.900Z","kind":"decision"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQPN2oZF514Wuvvwro+AES3RbXTHNsg/XYKAPzgrFs/nL+IyIl8OaxN9kxbKT0dDMyH0msAhQ4CPKeE/yOmCyzQA="}
{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3063,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:50.907304771Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"bc769fd2-2a01-5e36-aabe-bcd629e4657d","title":"[L519] Trace observations and sensitive-value handling have fixed collection and byte ceilings","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L519.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/observe/peritus-trace/src/domain/mod.rs:11-16`, `src/domain/observation.rs:88-115`, `src/codec.rs:53-94`, `src/redaction.rs:65-79`, `src/redaction.rs:215-249`.\n- Behavior: An observation admits at most 64 causal predecessors, 32 attributes and eight redactions, with strictly unique ordered keys/classes. The closed vocabulary currently has only 16 attribute keys and seven sensitivity classes, so those uniqueness rules are tighter in practice. SensitivePayload accepts only nonempty values of at most 16 MiB, even when the next operation merely omits their content. Decode allocates and reads collections under the general production codec bound before the smaller observation bounds are checked.\n- Consequence: Large otherwise omittable content fails at admission, and wider decoded collections can allocate before being rejected. Encrypted-vault finalization, digest, size and quarantine checks are integrity/privacy guards rather than session deadlines. All trace frames still use the shared production codec limits documented earlier.\n- Repair direction: Permit streaming omission and digest computation independently of whole-payload allocation, and check domain counts before allocating decoded collections. Preserve vault binding checks. No tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOL0LjB60a83Ke41TgCtssJgIcNvBwypwP4U7bG4GZ5LOcZyPum7TIWmxQL4xKV93oEAc/LAUyunCR1gSVn+lgE="}
