d effects reconcilable.\n\nAcceptance and nonregression: valid boundary values and values just beyond each synthetic cap, final wrapper/receipt growth, non-ASCII strings, arbitrarily split frames/pages, malformed or conflicting data, mixed-version decode and save/reopen round trips. Exercise the precise source-described failure path and the relevant byte/count/elapsed boundaries listed in this finding, plus ordinary small inputs. Check that legitimate work progresses after the former blocker while malformed input, conflicting identity, stale preimages and unauthorized scope still reject. Add fault injection at the affected acceptance/publication/recovery boundary and run the affected integration and formal checks on the final implementation. Source-derived risks remain distinct from executed reproductions; completion requires this evidence, not a promise that a plan alone cannot break anything.","created_at":"2026-10-06T13:27:49.900Z","kind":"decision"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQC7L+N43U4wC0aJrtuZCGJtHwj+ckxaPG4nvyE6cOXhIXb0r1Tkucvlh4HiUirZIHzS/E2tAhzIn6slK7rGPzQw="}
{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3087,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:50.966890464Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"3ef6cb65-0edc-5585-ad4c-eafbf72fd8bf","title":"[L534] Managed networking requires finite connection and owner lifetimes","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L534.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/runtime/peritus-network/src/plan.rs:34-90`, `src/accounting.rs:44-98`, `src/proxy/owner.rs:92-148`, `src/proxy/worker.rs:19-27`, `src/proxy/connect.rs:28-33`, `src/canonical.rs:8-59`.\n- Behavior: NetworkBounds requires positive connection duration and a positive proxy-owner duration at least as large, plus positive per-connection bytes and aggregate bytes at least as large. There is no None/unlimited mode. The owner stops accepting once elapsed time reaches total_millis, cancels workers and revokes its configured credential. Workers and upstream sockets install mandatory connection_millis read/write/connect timeouts and enforce elapsed connection accounting. Other ceilings are 1..1,024 accepted connections, 1..maximum_connections concurrent workers, 4..65,536 retained observations and 256 bytes..1 MiB headers. Canonical plans have a fixed 2 MiB bound checked after complete allocation.\n- Consequence: Long-running authorized network work is terminated by a synthetic lifetime even when making progress. Persistent process/session ownership does not remove these separate proxy deadlines. This crate exposes caller-selected values, not the actual installed caller values; native sandbox callers still require complete reading. Plan bytes bind these values and currently provide no widening/renewal operation.\n- Repair direction: Model absent execution deadlines directly, separate transport cancellation/progress from explicit authority expiry, and preserve recoverable quota/backpressure state. Do not substitute a very large integer for an unlimited lifecycle. No tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQN7NxrwPQ0+/IXpELbXQ5OUGp/JHwBDXnZdbz25aPvHxIyTnYL+6p1kvrF/UvpsSqSXhcndGtfF11URNPKbCXgk="}
