e and already owned effects reconcilable.\n\nAcceptance and nonregression: valid boundary values and values just beyond each synthetic cap, final wrapper/receipt growth, non-ASCII strings, arbitrarily split frames/pages, malformed or conflicting data, mixed-version decode and save/reopen round trips. Exercise the precise source-described failure path and the relevant byte/count/elapsed boundaries listed in this finding, plus ordinary small inputs. Check that legitimate work progresses after the former blocker while malformed input, conflicting identity, stale preimages and unauthorized scope still reject. Add fault injection at the affected acceptance/publication/recovery boundary and run the affected integration and formal checks on the final implementation. Source-derived risks remain distinct from executed reproductions; completion requires this evidence, not a promise that a plan alone cannot break anything.","created_at":"2026-10-06T13:27:49.900Z","kind":"decision"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQDBm+KgAswSEDywZRGBc/6KxzxJ0H1inFi/6ti8SzbTjz9/D540r+x5t+5BKwpdvWAIH/erSOT9GAHZ9tOqCpAU="}
{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3089,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:50.971652366Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"5ce7ed24-b9e4-5544-9bcc-a9ca070eca01","title":"[L535] Proxy acceptance quota counts rejected connections and never refills","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L535.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/runtime/peritus-network/src/proxy/owner.rs:103-136`, `src/proxy/owner.rs:38-74`, `src/proxy/mod.rs:143-147`.\n- Behavior: The owner increments accepted before checking worker capacity or its lifetime connection allowance. Every busy response, malformed/unauthenticated request and failed worker launch therefore consumes connection allowance. Completed workers release concurrency slots but never replenish accepted. After the allowance is exceeded, all new sockets receive 503 while the listener keeps running until cancellation or owner expiry. Observations retain the earliest fixed number and drop every later record; no drain or rotation API releases capacity, and snapshots clone the complete retained vector.\n- Consequence: Retry on a temporary busy response can permanently exhaust the proxy's lifetime admission quota. Waiting for workers does not restore admission. Later failure/closure/release diagnostics may be lost once the observation log fills. These count barriers are independent of the elapsed limits.\n- Repair direction: Separate socket acceptance, rejected admission, active concurrency and authorized lifetime usage. Provide durable progress/backpressure and rotating observational storage instead of an unrecoverable counter ceiling. No tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBmw2bpP2wR1745o5G9kmy5G1txUk70gSRdT+XK8kqNcq4wcsrrJTydmQwWrzTWGUwIkJQiq+Rgp5BgcZUMj+wg="}
