{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3101,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:51.000171129Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"a8700e44-572b-5dfa-9d32-953167b3a6e8","title":"[L541] Proxy redirect and HTTP restrictions turn some normal responses into connection failure","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L541.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/runtime/peritus-network/src/proxy/http.rs:84-144`, `src/proxy/http.rs:185-207`, `src/proxy/http.rs:260-264`, `src/redirect.rs:15-54`, `src/redirect.rs:81-99`, `src/proxy/redirect_worker.rs:13-30`, `src/proxy/worker.rs:91-118`.\n- Behavior: HTTP requests must use uppercase-letter methods and HTTP/1.0 or HTTP/1.1; every request Transfer-Encoding is rejected, including chunked bodies. Only plain-HTTP absolute targets, origin form or CONNECT are supported. Headers are UTF-8, names at most 128 bytes, rewritten heads at most 1 MiB. Redirect targets are at most 8,192 bytes and the counter is u8 with no unbounded mode. Despite its documentation mentioning HTTPS, RedirectTarget::parse accepts only http://. The proxy always attempts to process a 3xx Location; RedirectMode::Deny returns an error rather than forwarding that response. Following also rejects body-bearing requests and methods other than GET/HEAD.\n- Consequence: Ordinary HTTP-to-HTTPS redirects, disabled internal following or redirected uploads can surface as EOF/failed connection instead of a response the client can handle. Named/header/count ceilings add compatibility barriers. Removing request framing validation indiscriminately would undermine protocol integrity.\n- Repair direction: Forward ordinary redirect responses when internal following is disabled or unsupported, and define supported streaming/framing behavior explicitly. Preserve destination reauthorization for any internally followed successor. No tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQGrcLQ/Bv9+6S29g3yuZCaKTDtdpmQdf9qmZJWSqEwnJnDzeSk+eKqZ8EAPWuOfavpgHc7y+szFXdn1N9Ykb3gs="}
