nAcceptance and nonregression: renewal/adoption under the same authorized identity, revoked authority, stale epoch/revision, cross-scope requests, lost acknowledgements and restart, proving legitimate continuation without admitting unauthorized or duplicate effects. Exercise the precise source-described failure path and the relevant byte/count/elapsed boundaries listed in this finding, plus ordinary small inputs. Check that legitimate work progresses after the former blocker while malformed input, conflicting identity, stale preimages and unauthorized scope still reject. Add fault injection at the affected acceptance/publication/recovery boundary and run the affected integration and formal checks on the final implementation. Source-derived risks remain distinct from executed reproductions; completion requires this evidence, not a promise that a plan alone cannot break anything.","created_at":"2026-10-06T13:27:49.900Z","kind":"decision"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBPMjDotYnzncLFLYQvFBIMf3nXJKHA7cgYpVzsrkWwC2pJJGWVHAjc2DCaODhNrUYvwpmRaB4WIYhsO8s2n1QQ="}
{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3111,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:51.024212695Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"46c59074-6d4a-5784-ade7-0694c9d40b1a","title":"[L547] Redaction expiry disables matching even while secret material may remain live","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L547.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/runtime/peritus-secrets/src/fingerprint.rs:39-44`, `src/fingerprint.rs:51-58`, `src/fingerprint.rs:80-89`, `tests/secrets.rs:119-128`.\n- Behavior: A redaction set requires a finite nonzero expiration timestamp. At or beyond that timestamp, matching returns false. The test explicitly expects a previously matching secret to stop matching after expiry. There is no renewal or coupling to confirmed removal of delivered files and other material copies.\n- Consequence: A timer can disable an output-protection check while a continuing execution or retained artifact still contains the secret. This establishes the local contract, not a confirmed installed disclosure; callers and delivery lifetime need to be traced together.\n- Repair direction: Retain redaction coverage for the lifetime of material and outputs that can contain it, with explicit ownership and verified retirement instead of elapsed-time disappearance.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQF96nQGj17Jua5n6cAaPx+l9x6Pa2TTspuzLXrwQ/UrzgeS7wRSpLGtntaB2Hh6602K84fi2+mAFlqyAfoVbbw4="}
