{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3135,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:51.081983805Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"8e549c99-2c17-5c33-b60c-d39cecad3834","title":"[L561] Reference sandbox sessions are transient and their terminal operations do not reconcile repeats","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L561.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/runtime/peritus-sandbox/src/reference/session.rs:32-75`, `src/reference/session.rs:191-267`, `src/reference/session.rs:291-296`, `src/reference/mod.rs:198-231`, `src/verified.rs:116-133`, `src/canonical.rs:12-33`.\n- Behavior: Reference session state is held only in an in-memory object; canonical plan bytes have no decoder or session restore operation here. Cancel is idempotent only in prepared/active/cancelling phases; termination and release reject repeated terminal transitions. A fixed injected fault stays enabled for the whole object, so guidance to retry that operation cannot clear it. The reference backend is explicitly denied production admission.\n- Consequence: These semantics do not prove a native session can resume, reattach or repeat cleanup after restart. Reference-only transience is not evidence that the provider context itself expires, but it leaves a gap if reference lifecycle tests are treated as persistent-process qualification.\n- Repair direction: Define exact idempotent terminal reconciliation and durable native ownership in the real execution boundary; test reference and native recovery contracts separately and make injected transient faults genuinely retryable when testing retry.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQEzLghLHH56qBhShJ1Ke+BVcjvNQjXzpceCP44Qgsbm5XE6XPHX63Qq0PUVddRpOkSQ3bgkeyRr6vE5pT7jWTQ4="}
