{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3137,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:51.086310869Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"aabc5a5e-4ee0-59c0-a068-9ce100f58a8b","title":"[L562] Sandbox observation caps drop later detail and teardown classification checks only event positions","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L562.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/runtime/peritus-sandbox/src/reference/mod.rs:132-155`, `src/reference/mod.rs:222-230`, `src/reference/session.rs:317-357`, `src/observation.rs:127-138`, `src/refinement.rs:10-32`.\n- Behavior: The reference backend defaults to 4,096 retained observations, clamps this to the finite terminal event budget, and reserves five lifecycle events. Optional events are dropped with a counter; there is no drain/retirement API. Sequence and drop counts saturate. The public teardown helper returns complete from the first termination occurring before the first release in slice order without validating plan/backend identities, disposition or sequence. Proofs establish scalar compilation/admission conjunctions rather than resource release or liveness.\n- Consequence: Long-running diagnostic detail disappears despite continued execution. A supplied mixed or failed observation stream can be classified complete by the helper. The capacity reservation correctly avoids terminating reference work solely because optional observations fill up; it must not be reported as an execution event-count deadline.\n- Repair direction: Stream or retire acknowledged diagnostic observations while preserving lifecycle receipts, and require consistent identity, successful outcomes and valid ordering for teardown evidence.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHwqkt6/Y/NrUnG9NV9EcaxDAdQDDQZ7AKbwNfsguH/DSQyrs3f5iHGW2hZQQbA61vGPgJ/9s3y53MEdFnzrXwc="}
