ure, stalled helper/input readers, control-queue saturation, late start/exit races, parent loss and restart, proving cancellation responsiveness, no PID-reuse adoption and no duplicate process dispatch. Exercise the precise source-described failure path and the relevant byte/count/elapsed boundaries listed in this finding, plus ordinary small inputs. Check that legitimate work progresses after the former blocker while malformed input, conflicting identity, stale preimages and unauthorized scope still reject. Add fault injection at the affected acceptance/publication/recovery boundary and run the affected integration and formal checks on the final implementation. Source-derived risks remain distinct from executed reproductions; completion requires this evidence, not a promise that a plan alone cannot break anything.","created_at":"2026-10-06T13:27:49.900Z","kind":"decision"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQLqXwsb56X8rGX82s+yLO1apSNzfQtaRx8mP6xoqzvX8qlsxXrLm4wXWnk7mLuf0aBLDVWOvTUR0FWBNZ9Rgngg="}
{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3151,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:51.118704760Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"535394b1-4c8f-5e97-ad60-1761c9bf26dd","title":"[L570] Linux filesystem projection rejects several authorized creation plans","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L570.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/runtime/peritus-sandbox-linux/src/filesystem.rs:224-347`; `src/filesystem/private.rs:1-38` in the same crate.\n- Behavior: Projection canonicalizes rule paths and requires required paths to exist, including paths required for creation. Exact directory rules, exact create/remove rules, and selective deny masks are rejected. An absent protected metadata root under a creatable parent rejects the plan, and writable paths must remain inside the workspace. Private roots also require explicit bootstrap dependencies.\n- Consequence: Authorized creation of a new path can fail because the path does not yet exist. Missing metadata directories can block ordinary workspace creation, and broader contract capabilities do not all have native representations.\n- Repair direction: Represent absent targets through verified parent ownership and exact creation semantics. Prepare protected metadata before admitting writes, and expose native representability as an explicit capability rather than a late preparation failure. Keep alias and containment checks.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJ6vg4U1LI+Jl+/jLLEol4we4Tjg+l14nObMD0s67vOBICmq1XqV77zeifBv/2K359ppzONnRL+Lqq15