concilable.\n\nAcceptance and nonregression: long-running commands, output and stdin pressure, stalled helper/input readers, control-queue saturation, late start/exit races, parent loss and restart, proving cancellation responsiveness, no PID-reuse adoption and no duplicate process dispatch. Exercise the precise source-described failure path and the relevant byte/count/elapsed boundaries listed in this finding, plus ordinary small inputs. Check that legitimate work progresses after the former blocker while malformed input, conflicting identity, stale preimages and unauthorized scope still reject. Add fault injection at the affected acceptance/publication/recovery boundary and run the affected integration and formal checks on the final implementation. Source-derived risks remain distinct from executed reproductions; completion requires this evidence, not a promise that a plan alone cannot break anything.","created_at":"2026-10-06T13:27:49.900Z","kind":"decision"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMZPW0ppO+qVMR9s1NwuACS/31mKFkw1SbSIn3Im+pnxOmEkGdrOdXGn/VdnhcuVcb6FHSuDgBNInx6PVrT8SgA="}
{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3169,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:51.160255983Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"f3d1bc32-bfea-539f-9cdd-a058eefed2b4","title":"[L584] Workspace restart inspection performs full synchronous scans and can block unrelated recovery","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L584.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/runtime/peritus-workspace/src/reconcile.rs:205-250,255-349`; `src/folder_mutation/recovery.rs:209-267,305-337`; `src/transaction_namespace.rs:103-121` in the same crate.\n- Behavior: Git-workspace reconciliation collects and sorts every namespace entry, invokes patch recovery for every canonical transaction, performs full Git reconciliation, and synchronously finalizes an artifact. There is no cancellation or paging in this path. Unrelated entries make the Git workspace dirty; folder recovery rejects any other transaction or unrelated entry before reconciling its exact target. Rolled-back cleanup-pending state is recorded in the digest but does not independently clear the Git transaction-clean flag.\n- Consequence: Large or stalled storage can make recovery appear locked without a deadline. Another outstanding folder transaction can prevent exact-target recovery, and a cleanup obligation may remain while the Git classifier reports clean. Artifact failure overrides even a completed inspection to indeterminate.\n- Repair direction: Persist an indexed recovery cursor and separate exact transaction repair, cleanup obligations, inspection evidence, and evidence publication. Keep unknown entries visible without denying every independent exact repair, and retain cancellation and retry ownership throughout.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJ6f/0j6gg2UsFp6sR9zaZlkIjce21dIeTOt47uRvNahyON8CDLbRq8/GGDRG8cX4tc45H8yO4lGJdfowTAE5g0="}
