ressure, stalled helper/input readers, control-queue saturation, late start/exit races, parent loss and restart, proving cancellation responsiveness, no PID-reuse adoption and no duplicate process dispatch. Exercise the precise source-described failure path and the relevant byte/count/elapsed boundaries listed in this finding, plus ordinary small inputs. Check that legitimate work progresses after the former blocker while malformed input, conflicting identity, stale preimages and unauthorized scope still reject. Add fault injection at the affected acceptance/publication/recovery boundary and run the affected integration and formal checks on the final implementation. Source-derived risks remain distinct from executed reproductions; completion requires this evidence, not a promise that a plan alone cannot break anything.","created_at":"2026-10-06T13:27:49.900Z","kind":"decision"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQAzXDkDLoAKQ/QjJAFLiJaFs7s0viRKY8MIrjOg9z+wVbb82gT5FsCZwGv52QsjnVbCW8uWvtsWI9EtDKKAL1A8="}
{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3177,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:51.177642463Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"413af078-a5cb-5a1d-8c5f-9e5f78851961","title":"[L591] macOS profile compilation narrows several accepted contract capabilities","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L591.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/runtime/peritus-sandbox-macos/src/filesystem.rs:13-15,87-159,189-242,316-329`; `src/preparation/config.rs:33-53`; `src/environment.rs:13-15,29-42,92-105`; `src/manifest/fields.rs:68-94,97-123` in the same crate.\n- Behavior: Seatbelt profiles are capped at 256 KiB and configuration at 256 additional protected roots before deduplication. Discovery and metadata bits must match for every filesystem rule. Allowed UDP is unsupported and TCP egress requires an exact managed loopback proxy. Non-UTF-8/control-bearing paths are rejected. Native environment assignment count is capped at 1,024, names at 255 bytes, and values at 64 KiB; reserved delivery names are compared without case sensitivity.\n- Consequence: Logically accepted capabilities can be rejected during native projection, and Unix environment names differing only by case can conflict with protected-delivery admission. These representability/integrity constraints are not execution lifetimes. The effective limits may be tighter at upstream process or sandbox boundaries.\n- Repair direction: Advertise and validate native representability before action consumption, use platform-correct environment identity, and version larger representations where needed while preserving metadata protection and exact network authorization.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQGbN6vkD8SXbtlaUYXFR0BodWGCcmBMaR+JO6yz2DJpYD01BV5k3LD/TKI94JsvvssJt0PtgXEoO6tNAAB3dTgE="}
