ned effects reconcilable.\n\nAcceptance and nonregression: long-running commands, output and stdin pressure, stalled helper/input readers, control-queue saturation, late start/exit races, parent loss and restart, proving cancellation responsiveness, no PID-reuse adoption and no duplicate process dispatch. Exercise the precise source-described failure path and the relevant byte/count/elapsed boundaries listed in this finding, plus ordinary small inputs. Check that legitimate work progresses after the former blocker while malformed input, conflicting identity, stale preimages and unauthorized scope still reject. Add fault injection at the affected acceptance/publication/recovery boundary and run the affected integration and formal checks on the final implementation. Source-derived risks remain distinct from executed reproductions; completion requires this evidence, not a promise that a plan alone cannot break anything.","created_at":"2026-10-06T13:27:49.900Z","kind":"decision"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJ/3lcuAxJ0zeaxVy3SpR1K1KJmE9GN39xVEwmqHdHq9h6q2vd0UXfzXfELjC4bkq5HGyxUbi2PT84vhnrXmCw4="}
{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3179,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:51.182238646Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"c65fb9fc-498d-5d6c-9dac-0b42491e6683","title":"[L592] Configured macOS proxy or secret support rejects plans that do not use it","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L592.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/runtime/peritus-sandbox-macos/src/preparation.rs:49-54,84-101,123-187,275-311`.\n- Behavior: Backend construction masks probed features according to installed proxy/secret preparations. Authorized preparation then requires configured proxy presence to equal whether the plan permits egress, and secret preparation presence to equal whether secret requirements are nonempty. Resource and manifest representability checks occur after proxy and secret preparation.\n- Consequence: A backend configured for network or secret support cannot prepare a deny-all/no-secret plan with those optional configurations still present. A later profile or manifest failure also occurs after protected resources have been allocated and the C2 action consumed.\n- Repair direction: Distinguish installed capability from per-execution use, prepare only the resources selected by the exact plan, and perform inert representability checks before allocation. Preserve durable cleanup ownership for later failures.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJ6f9jV8BaIAGrrRbWVxw4M9QmUStylcXg4zZRLPaeEw+yiWaH0t32nAjp4exEeWCEnoEN3HMAv5PInTXft8JAo="}
