{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3193,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:51.213514430Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"9eac70fa-921c-5e09-87bf-8296f539188e","title":"[L599] macOS recovery stores classifications rather than a reconstructible session owner","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L599.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/runtime/peritus-sandbox-macos/src/recovery.rs:15-24,125-132,213-309`; `src/recovery/codec.rs:19-72,75-97`; `src/session.rs:93-109,127-165,270-274`; `src/session/adapter.rs:22-44` in the same crate.\n- Behavior: Recovery serializes digests, optional root PID/group, activation, and five cleanup booleans. It omits process birth identity, live handles/proxy/secret ownership, resource-monitor state, and the session phase. Decoding reconstructs a record only; the session constructor always creates a fresh prepared owner. Classification accepts a caller-supplied equal identity as live ownership. Accessible absence after activation remains indeterminate until cleanup is complete; pre-activation absence is classified clean despite incomplete resource-family cleanup. Resource polling compares PID/group and a containment flag without birth identity in the retained record.\n- Consequence: This crate's record cannot reattach the original live execution after owner restart. PID/group equality alone cannot distinguish reuse. The pre-activation absence branch can overstate cleanup of independently prepared proxy/secrets; activated absence can strand cleanup classification. No synthetic TTL is needed for these persistence failures.\n- Repair direction: Persist an exact reconstructible owner record with native birth identities, each outstanding cleanup obligation, and independently inspectable resource state; add adoption and continued supervision transitions distinct from termination-only classification.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQL1Vo0SWtCBfjoFAOmgnKH4EI6dlYYuw8HQZse/6R4K7/LWFtzJg6HTx16QBBSH5ep7t3gFdoxSk+aVuWnV+6w0="}
