talled helper/input readers, control-queue saturation, late start/exit races, parent loss and restart, proving cancellation responsiveness, no PID-reuse adoption and no duplicate process dispatch. Exercise the precise source-described failure path and the relevant byte/count/elapsed boundaries listed in this finding, plus ordinary small inputs. Check that legitimate work progresses after the former blocker while malformed input, conflicting identity, stale preimages and unauthorized scope still reject. Add fault injection at the affected acceptance/publication/recovery boundary and run the affected integration and formal checks on the final implementation. Source-derived risks remain distinct from executed reproductions; completion requires this evidence, not a promise that a plan alone cannot break anything.","created_at":"2026-10-06T13:27:49.900Z","kind":"decision"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJGNaS1deO1hI/SKLG179IWTdx5lvO1G+c8NugCGonWwc3pH2N8mnDn8RVq7ajJV2sl+qWFTDZ7Km2QJ7SGCFgg="}
{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3219,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:51.273223596Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"2bc8f99d-56a6-524e-97ae-d6c5bd22a78b","title":"[L613] Windows normal termination produces recovery bytes its decoder rejects","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L613.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/runtime/peritus-sandbox-windows/src/session.rs:216-221`; `src/recovery.rs:108-126,180-202`; `tests/contracts.rs:234-240`; `tests/windows_conformance_support/projection.rs:119-125` in the same crate.\n- Behavior: Normal termination advances recovery to `Terminated` with ACL/secret cleanup false and helper-reaped true. The writer allows and encodes this state. The decoder rejects any record with at least one true cleanup flag unless all three are true. Tests pass through the same partial state but decode only after final release.\n- Consequence: Reopening a normal terminated-but-not-released execution rejects its valid emitted recovery record and quarantines it. This source-derived writer/reader mismatch is a direct restart blocker without any timeout.\n- Repair direction: Make independently progressing cleanup dimensions canonical and reopenable at every emitted phase; verify round trips after each lifecycle and cleanup transition, not just complete release.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNtmi5DXpmlM3yQMC8Q6klTwP1P1z1dMT57yES2jFVom17KxsJ55MZpPr33XS2T7h8IPV14eOOXMdmb/UDqBqwo="}
