ong-running commands, output and stdin pressure, stalled helper/input readers, control-queue saturation, late start/exit races, parent loss and restart, proving cancellation responsiveness, no PID-reuse adoption and no duplicate process dispatch. Exercise the precise source-described failure path and the relevant byte/count/elapsed boundaries listed in this finding, plus ordinary small inputs. Check that legitimate work progresses after the former blocker while malformed input, conflicting identity, stale preimages and unauthorized scope still reject. Add fault injection at the affected acceptance/publication/recovery boundary and run the affected integration and formal checks on the final implementation. Source-derived risks remain distinct from executed reproductions; completion requires this evidence, not a promise that a plan alone cannot break anything.","created_at":"2026-10-06T13:27:49.900Z","kind":"decision"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQG8D3gSOvscUG0gRuAXcbk4bkvFGHfnaUT1vap+9yPogB3ovaHV37VPdWQk9i1gaA2b+X+yKMyuZdfzBeIjsVQY="}
{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3221,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:51.277750129Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"d2fede54-6215-59d1-a399-bd0686f25a95","title":"[L614] Windows recovery cannot reconstruct or identify a live native owner","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L614.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/runtime/peritus-sandbox-windows/src/recovery.rs:15-22,79-101,250-293`; `src/session.rs:26-40,96-110,189-202`; `src/identity.rs:11-26`; `src/native/job.rs:20-26` in the same crate.\n- Behavior: Recovery identity contains only logical process identity and five digests; it omits native PID/birth identities, an openable job identifier, live channels, proxy/filter ownership and exact ACL reversal records. The Job Object is unnamed. Decoding reconstructs the record only, while session construction always creates prepared state. Classification consumes a caller-supplied `RecoveryProbe`, with no native inspection/adoption implementation in this crate; absent resources without complete cleanup remain indeterminate. Activation retains only a containment Boolean and does not add native identity to recovery.\n- Consequence: Digest equality is insufficient to reconnect the exact surviving helper/target and continue supervision. Owner loss strands independent cleanup obligations even if target processes are gone. The record is durable supporting metadata rather than durable session ownership.\n- Repair direction: Persist independently inspectable native identities and resumable cleanup ownership, add exact native inspection/adoption, and retain logical execution continuity through ownership transfer instead of requiring a fresh prepared session.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQAdMzzmxen6ih6NCeygFz/+NJvnAkwUveBZvFPFXdQffXKA/bRk+/4pvdq9SNAGPivOW9VjIxZcxs3MdDLU1TAk="}
