{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3237,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:51.318300965Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"5e24989a-2caf-5807-88b4-75ab4f2c7c2a","title":"[L623] Evidence work repeats synchronous whole-history and artifact verification without a resumable work owner","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L623.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/state/peritus-evidence/src/admission.rs:35-75,93-127`; `src/sqlite/store.rs:81-104,196-216,274-289`; `src/bundle/plan.rs:125-177,206-238`; `src/bundle/assemble.rs:80-119`; `src/bundle/verify.rs:145-168,278-284` in the same crate.\n- Behavior: Admission scans the checked export's artifact references and verifies artifact bytes before recognizing an exact retry. Bundle planning reloads records for freshness, verifies duplicate artifact references before deduplication, and linearly searches records for each frame. Assembly verifies each artifact again and then hashes its stream; offline verification similarly matches each frame against the full record list. The Read/Write interfaces provide no cancellation or durable cursor, and final EOF validation can block on a still-open stream.\n- Consequence: Growing history and repeated retries can spend substantial time reading and hashing while producing no new durable result. EOF can wait indefinitely; this is an unowned blocking operation, not an artificial session deadline.\n- Repair direction: Bind verified content to immutable digests and one transaction snapshot, index frames and artifact references, recognize durable retries before redundant work when safe, and persist cancellable phase/cursor progress. Source review only; no tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOOPdk31K14CYmIRnFHxfRZag3hYmmpzC9Il8NkG3y5Hkzu4RnAG1W6tdBFYjUrBQcSWXSfhFbm0VnAq2hZ5Sw4="}
