{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3251,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:51.353461930Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"4d01649c-f9f0-5f23-92bf-ee682ade9537","title":"[L634] Filesystem schemas impose whole-file and inline-mutation ceilings without ranged alternatives","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L634.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/tools/peritus-tools-fs/src/input.rs:7-16,79-86,119-133,281-304,320-344`; `src/schemas.rs:7-38,61-75,78-118`; `src/decoder.rs:25-41,95-116`; `src/read.rs:220-232`; `src/catalog.rs:105-119` in the same crate.\n- Behavior: fs.read requires a positive caller byte bound no larger than 48 KiB and has no offset, line range, chunk cursor, or artifact result. Discovery/search require depth 1..64 and entries 1..100,000; search additionally requires a literal no longer than 4,096 bytes, a per-file limit up to 8 MiB, total UTF-8 bytes up to 64 MiB, and matches up to 10,000. Mutation schemas accept content strings up to 65,536 bytes and present preimage sizes up to 8 MiB; patch arrays require 1..1,024 edits and compile against the patch crate's separate byte/operation ceilings. Paths have a 4,096-byte schema ceiling. Binary content consumes its base64-expanded string allowance. All descriptors impose 8 MiB output, 16,384-byte human/model output, and count fields of one, while explicitly selecting no timeout.\n- Consequence: A legitimate source file larger than 48 KiB cannot be read with this tool, and a larger replacement cannot be supplied inline even when the lower patch engine supports more bytes. Raising the invocation timeout does not change these schema barriers.\n- Repair direction: Provide exact digest-bound range/chunk reads and streamed/artifact mutation inputs with persistent cursors; distinguish envelope-sized chunks from limits on the total job. Source review only; no tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQAE2yHgPmdo1+WDXPgptIN9iYfzxmisrR7TMNI7dlB0zdVkx4hlIwxE6m6C7L0dohwAbBYfv/CUL6YXPYMq0JQs="}
