nce and nonregression: valid boundary values and values just beyond each synthetic cap, final wrapper/receipt growth, non-ASCII strings, arbitrarily split frames/pages, malformed or conflicting data, mixed-version decode and save/reopen round trips. Exercise the precise source-described failure path and the relevant byte/count/elapsed boundaries listed in this finding, plus ordinary small inputs. Check that legitimate work progresses after the former blocker while malformed input, conflicting identity, stale preimages and unauthorized scope still reject. Add fault injection at the affected acceptance/publication/recovery boundary and run the affected integration and formal checks on the final implementation. Source-derived risks remain distinct from executed reproductions; completion requires this evidence, not a promise that a plan alone cannot break anything.","created_at":"2026-10-06T13:27:49.900Z","kind":"decision"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQGoWABigFuvN+4n6JvfMXtctajkwKIv+ot0zmr4wvlEjx4vtxUHOxY5/UpJ3h27ygusSAzyobnM1128yif8TcgU="}
{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3267,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:51.391175994Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"7f587220-cc63-57cf-a26d-22de72209b77","title":"[L648] Quality discovery can reject the whole catalog and consume its retry inputs","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L648.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/tools/peritus-tools-quality/src/discovery.rs:18,63-121`; `src/discovery/cargo.rs:7-34`; `src/discovery/just.rs:9-59`; `src/dispatcher/discover.rs:87-119,123-173`.\n- Behavior: Discovery reads only root Cargo.toml and Justfile/justfile, each at most 1 MiB. Just scanning rejects more than 16,384 lines or 1,024 recipe names; it recognizes simple public zero-argument-looking headers, not the complete Just grammar. Every valid TOML table creates four all-targets/all-features Cargo checks. Duplicate names across explicit definitions, Cargo, or both Justfile spellings reject the whole catalog. The dispatcher takes its explicit vector before inspection and emits every complete check in one production JSON value; it retains the catalog only after terminal envelope success. That envelope has no cursor/artifact fallback and fewer allowed members than a 1,024-entry catalog needs.\n- Consequence: A large or colliding surface can block even otherwise valid explicit checks, and retrying the same dispatcher sees consumed input. Unsupported discovery syntax is silently absent. Catalog shape/size failure is classified Protocol/Never rather than exposing the inspection/parser cause or a resumable result.\n- Repair direction: Preserve explicit catalog availability and discovery diagnostics, reconcile names deliberately, use actual tool metadata for discovery, and serve large immutable catalogs in resumable pages before consuming retry ownership.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQEGySwcbTt5cUw7KOoRjTZSJ2mJXN0ntLGWHt85urwBKp2i5kV8jsTHcCeqqomBMNnulFpzuacuJEODT18HkPgY="}
