nd nonregression: valid boundary values and values just beyond each synthetic cap, final wrapper/receipt growth, non-ASCII strings, arbitrarily split frames/pages, malformed or conflicting data, mixed-version decode and save/reopen round trips. Exercise the precise source-described failure path and the relevant byte/count/elapsed boundaries listed in this finding, plus ordinary small inputs. Check that legitimate work progresses after the former blocker while malformed input, conflicting identity, stale preimages and unauthorized scope still reject. Add fault injection at the affected acceptance/publication/recovery boundary and run the affected integration and formal checks on the final implementation. Source-derived risks remain distinct from executed reproductions; completion requires this evidence, not a promise that a plan alone cannot break anything.","created_at":"2026-10-06T13:27:49.900Z","kind":"decision"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCKrXuFdMTqcIi8Wc1nPaPGL0tWFurWxRvK/0nD9SSYLkKj7+HIQ7TIGLAzwCHLVZFyGqdN4ZczoG1lAN3HOcAQ="}
{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3279,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:51.418851489Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"389cc2de-4be6-5b53-ae2d-f0cee729fc1c","title":"[L658] Product workspace recent-list limits still remove discoverable choices; retained registrations are a different surface","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L658.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/app/peritus-product-state/src/workspace/selection.rs:9-19,29-54,61-156,239-273`; `src/workspace/profile.rs:92-115,201-247`.\n- Behavior: Only 32 recent profiles are retained in the selectable/find-by-repository inventory. Eviction or removal preserves managed trusted registrations, without a numeric history cap, but drops direct-folder and restricted profiles from that retention surface. select/find/active search only recent entries. Retained registrations deduplicate by workspace identity or repository root. Validation requires registered roots/identities to be unique and performs pairwise scans. The 4,097-entry history fixture constructs retained records directly without validating the complete selection or effectful launcher catalog.\n- Consequence: More than 32 chosen folders can lose their remembered selection/trust facts even though old runtime history may exist elsewhere. Managed registration history avoids that eviction, but cannot independently be selected from here; replacing a root's retained registration can remove references to an older lineage. This is not evidence that a provider session itself expires at 32 workspaces. Unbounded retained history also has quadratic validation work.\n- Repair direction: Separate paged presentation recency from a durable complete workspace registry, retain all lineages required by active runs, and support lookup/adoption outside the presentation list.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQAEOlaNV7RCVzgrv4qgBSkxgkN1Hh/h55X5T+AMi1lAUcxwW+7xuyQXbtuqSOQ9S0CGEr0XpfP0frFuYLfKXNgs="}
