{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3281,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:51.423241911Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"fc9770e5-30ce-587b-b467-3843c5727f7a","title":"[L659] Product-state shape gates are strict schema/identity rules rather than session timeouts","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L659.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/app/peritus-product-state/src/state.rs:11-70,121-209`; `src/provider.rs:101-132,136-228,268-290`; `src/provider/account.rs:10-61`; `src/provider/kind.rs:7-91`; `src/phase.rs:18-37`; `src/verified.rs:7-149`.\n- Behavior: State accepts only schema 1 and denies unknown fields; no explicit version migration exists here. Bootstrap can only repeat/advance one phase. Generations saturate at u64::MAX rather than retaining strict advancement at that physical boundary. Provider routes are the closed 13 kinds, one direct profile per kind, 256-byte models/credential refs, 2,048-byte endpoints, 128-byte headers, absolute 32,768-byte account executable paths. Failover is explicit/default-off and requires two selected provider kinds. This pure state stores bootstrap/provider/workspace facts and no live-daemon readiness or process/context owner.\n- Consequence: Unsupported versions and malformed canonical identities are intentional admission barriers, not artificial execution deadlines. The closed route shape limits multiple routes of one kind; schema changes require migration in composition. Persisting this document alone cannot prove durable runtime/context recovery. Generation saturation is a physical boundary, not a practical daily session timer.\n- Repair direction: Preserve integrity validation and user failover consent, provide explicit schema/route migration, and keep runtime recovery ownership durably linked through its actual owner subsystem.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQLknk8z54Fq7V196K8PdA9/tp0lF4sX7EwqgxT4ccNZq+2wDnMXvV7juB6wqjv0dQ0Mv0OUB8JjggACgCvIA4AE="}
