able and already owned effects reconcilable.\n\nAcceptance and nonregression: valid boundary values and values just beyond each synthetic cap, final wrapper/receipt growth, non-ASCII strings, arbitrarily split frames/pages, malformed or conflicting data, mixed-version decode and save/reopen round trips. Exercise the precise source-described failure path and the relevant byte/count/elapsed boundaries listed in this finding, plus ordinary small inputs. Check that legitimate work progresses after the former blocker while malformed input, conflicting identity, stale preimages and unauthorized scope still reject. Add fault injection at the affected acceptance/publication/recovery boundary and run the affected integration and formal checks on the final implementation. Source-derived risks remain distinct from executed reproductions; completion requires this evidence, not a promise that a plan alone cannot break anything.","created_at":"2026-10-06T13:27:49.900Z","kind":"decision"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQKlS4JPzZ3PPPXT9Kzkm2M9Xk60HMBznMuMgvUctCA/vlURcICUeu3hSiIrhCLVfuwRUief4fq6zq0965NuBDQk="}
{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3293,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:51.449916721Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"37e0ca25-4597-5ba9-be37-e052f1da7d7d","title":"[L665] Direct-folder navigation and global tool allowlisting depend on the active presentation selection","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L665.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/app/peritus-launcher/src/app/navigation.rs:39-58`; `src/app/navigation/tests.rs:75-106`; `src/bootstrap/configuration/folder.rs:8-22`; `src/bootstrap/configuration.rs:128-158`; `src/workspace_setup/managed/tests.rs:34-64`.\n- Behavior: Navigation searches managed trusted registered profiles plus only the active profile. Inactive direct folders are rejected even when remembered; the regression explicitly expects that rejection. Generated configuration similarly includes only the active direct folder. The global C4 allowlist is populated solely when the active profile is Trusted; it is empty otherwise, although old managed registrations remain configured and navigable. Switching/forgetting choices publishes a new configuration generation.\n- Consequence: A conversation in an inactive folder cannot reopen through this launcher surface, and browsing a restricted active choice can disable the shared C4 tool surface for other registered workspaces. This is a presentation/configuration coupling blocker, not a legitimate grant of another workspace's authority or evidence of a timer.\n- Repair direction: Retain durable folder/workspace registrations needed by runs and resolve exact conversation scope independently of active presentation selection. Derive tool admission per authorized target while preserving explicit trust and target identity checks.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNBQ7GeYezAoBJdo8zQSmmbBct/XQO0/FjPdFwzW1eFtj1wFCWeBV36dyy4Hxy4dJQh6T1sem0J5hHQbnxOyHw8="}
