{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3339,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:51.557202915Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"bfe52a52-0c3d-5242-abd8-7ce230dfc107","title":"[L697] Pure terminal attachment state has no saved-position restoration or replay admission","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L697.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/app/peritus-app-protocol/src/terminal/state.rs:31-60,84-133,161-237`; `src/terminal/messages.rs:8-44,145-191,260-311`; `src/terminal/verified.rs:7-37,39-83`; `src/verified/mod.rs:226-277` in the same crate.\n- Behavior: TerminalState creates Attached at sequence/offset zero. Output must match the exact next position; replayed output is rejected. Detach/cancel retain exact idempotent facts and permanently end the attachment; subsequent output and exit are rejected. There is no restore/reattach constructor in this state module. Exit requires the exact output fence; the positive-signal check rejects Signal(0) but accepts negative i32 signals. Separate generic verified terminal predicates use last-sequence-plus-one accounting, while this implementation carries next-sequence accounting directly.\n- Consequence: Keeping a native process alive does not suffice to reconnect its observer; retained position and attachment disposition must be reconstructed through another layer. The arithmetic proofs do not certify persistence or adoption. Negative signal acceptance is a classification defect, not an execution deadline.\n- Repair direction: Persist and reconcile observer positions and explicit attachment outcomes, define replay semantics without weakening exact process bindings, and align exit-domain validation. No tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQE1X9+JNxiz7xxa8CI6uTXRrXc/VNWC9kIyRQofBlce3+qg0raKwUDewLGcENrW1h0IAAYaCqRLU1lOkyKEb9wM="}
