lable.\n\nAcceptance and nonregression: large histories and non-ASCII fields, queue/connection pressure, delayed acknowledgements, subscription gaps, disconnect/reconnect and daemon restart, proving snapshot recovery, preserved selection/context, responsive controls and no duplicate command. Exercise the precise source-described failure path and the relevant byte/count/elapsed boundaries listed in this finding, plus ordinary small inputs. Check that legitimate work progresses after the former blocker while malformed input, conflicting identity, stale preimages and unauthorized scope still reject. Add fault injection at the affected acceptance/publication/recovery boundary and run the affected integration and formal checks on the final implementation. Source-derived risks remain distinct from executed reproductions; completion requires this evidence, not a promise that a plan alone cannot break anything.","created_at":"2026-10-06T13:27:49.900Z","kind":"decision"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQO3wUUKcRGVlMRQc5wADCMSfj6gayOpAipS7vysgxvjZZyliypArX0o1ni3vFtqJ4UfplpN/2oncOOY+Dm+/1Ag="}
{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3363,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:51.609922657Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"8c17a952-879b-562a-85ef-1ccc4245129c","title":"[L709] File selection cannot address any source beyond 64 MiB and has a narrower import-label gate","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L709.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/app/peritus-app-protocol/src/workbench/files.rs:15-16,47-56,86-103`; `src/workbench/files/preview.rs:20-33,60-67,85-100`; `src/workbench/files/import.rs:21-29,60-71,102-114`; `src/wire/workbench_files.rs:18-24,66-82,119-135` in the same crate.\n- Behavior: Selected UTF-8 text is limited to 256 KiB; complete source metadata is limited to 64 MiB, byte-range end is limited to 64 MiB, and line-range last is capped at 64 million. Consequently an explicit small range cannot represent a source larger than 64 MiB through this metadata. Workspace path/label permits 4,096 bytes while import requires at most 1,024. Model identifiers are at most 512 bytes. Empty file transfers/selections are allowed. Whole selection identities/digests and provider revision are confirmation-bound; external imported labels are not reopened as paths.\n- Consequence: Large logs/generated files cannot be attached even as a small explicitly selected range, and valid workspace descriptors can fail after switching to import. These are fixed product representation policies rather than measured provider or storage capacity.\n- Repair direction: Separate complete-source metadata/addressability from chosen model-input chunk size; provide scalable ranged selection and consistent inert labels while retaining authority/digest fences. No tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCTaDWGWMWg1P0nEQ9eb5plDxWydHr1B+U8mVO+m1YHB6HN8WUORftyboM5aRIXaC+4lV8DR8GLU/+q6KjxXIwU="}
