{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3367,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:51.618423168Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"8228bcff-acec-5091-8f12-d6251fff0c8c","title":"[L711] Conversation-library offset pagination has no revision snapshot fence or exact coverage validation","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L711.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/app/peritus-app-protocol/src/workbench/library.rs:9-13,58-68,128-136,244-270,337-348`; `src/wire/workbench_library.rs:12-50,113-128,154-185`; `src/workbench/library/fork.rs:9-13,34-56,122-126` in the same crate.\n- Behavior: Library pages are 1..64 items with u32 total/offset, literal queries at most 256 bytes, snippets 512 bytes and handoffs 1,024 bytes. Query carries no catalog revision/snapshot fence. Page validates only item count against requested limit and that next_offset advances within total; it does not require offset <= total, exact number/unique scoped items, or a next offset when more results exist. Forks deliberately start non-running, with read-only current-workspace mode or isolated writable mode, and no execution budget fields in the request.\n- Consequence: Offset pagination can skip/repeat conversations if live ordering changes between requests, and DTO shape alone can accept incomplete library results as final. Read-only fork execution restriction is an explicit authority boundary, not a synthetic session deadline.\n- Repair direction: Use stable snapshot/cursor pagination with exact coverage and scope checks; preserve explicit fork modes and non-running creation. No tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMi9dK/Tkcb1p9/66s0gWyjI3hr90w4BvlGaPW5sMrRXbzJ8m7UUNQnCtiQci1B3vFrtX02v0DbkV1ijVQQH+w0="}
