ce and nonregression: large and multi-file candidates, repeated valid repair cycles, changed candidate facts, delayed reviews, local/offline verification, restart mid-gate and cancellation, proving correct repair handoff without accepting a failed candidate or rereading unchanged evidence forever. Exercise the precise source-described failure path and the relevant byte/count/elapsed boundaries listed in this finding, plus ordinary small inputs. Check that legitimate work progresses after the former blocker while malformed input, conflicting identity, stale preimages and unauthorized scope still reject. Add fault injection at the affected acceptance/publication/recovery boundary and run the affected integration and formal checks on the final implementation. Source-derived risks remain distinct from executed reproductions; completion requires this evidence, not a promise that a plan alone cannot break anything.","created_at":"2026-10-06T13:27:49.900Z","kind":"decision"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQPfXPilghtMGI+tRI213+Y7llka/390ug0z31t0fzBPNSGao2/XT1MKJ6h64febk659vnyzMBaSBoWrZKk4FNQU="}
{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3371,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:51.626967176Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"bf5d12c4-8f47-5bbc-946c-09b947e2a361","title":"[L714] Complete guidance rendering fails above 64 KiB without a retrieval continuation","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L714.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/app/peritus-app-protocol/src/workbench/memory.rs:16-23`; `src/workbench/memory/render.rs:61-129,137-172`; `src/workbench/memory/inspection.rs:23-32,117-143`; `src/workbench/memory/transition.rs:178-199`; `src/workbench/memory/tests.rs:48-136,172-197` in the same crate.\n- Behavior: Saved text is at most 8 KiB and forget reason 1 KiB. Inspection has 32-row bounded, revision/scope-checked pages with u32 offsets and no fixed total-history bound here, but it accepts short/empty pages before total end. Rendering scans/indexes all supplied records/tombstones, selects all eligible records, sorts pinned first, and fails once escaped text plus provenance exceeds 64 KiB. It does not enforce the documented 32-record rendering limit or select a bounded subset. Pure mutations accept supplied dependency revisions at least the record's revision; current global CAS is a host responsibility. Forget retains content-free tombstones and earlier immutable audit material.\n- Consequence: Increasing saved project guidance can make request construction fail even though each record is individually valid. Pinning changes ordering but cannot avoid the complete-render capacity failure. These records preserve explicit guidance, not provider context-window ownership.\n- Repair direction: Keep the complete durable registry and provide explicit inspectable retrieval selections/artifact handles under actual request capacity, with stable paging and host CAS. Preserve scope, tombstone dominance and exact accepted-content provenance. No tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFt5hY2lYV7VQDvhlonos56A5AX2qH0t17BkVXWL2bw81WoGPZ70aQNxuhy3R9Z9n7RH7mSv+ReRt+nIRcMwWA0="}
