{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3373,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:51.631218468Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"a8ce745e-3f18-5a36-b833-d5cee52e975f","title":"[L715] Initialization uses fixed whole-file source, patch and diff ceilings","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L715.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/app/peritus-app-protocol/src/workbench/init.rs:17-25,94-103,188-202,255-280`; `src/workbench/init/proposal.rs:25-55,62-91`; `src/workbench/init/render.rs:5-33,68-99`; `src/wire/workbench_init.rs:50-66,121-150,171-203`; `src/wire/workbench_init/tests.rs:83-95` in the same crate.\n- Behavior: Every discovered source and original/proposed AGENTS.md is capped at 256 KiB; exact whole-file diff is capped at 768 KiB. Commands permit 128-byte executable, 1,024-byte arguments and u16 argument/source/command counts, with stricter generic codec collection ceilings on wire. from_discovery constructs complete proposed content and a whole-file removal/addition diff before checking resulting bounds; decoding validates/re-renders those facts. Existing managed markers must be exactly one correctly ordered pair. Accepting the patch does not execute discovered commands. A test admits 17 arguments beyond an older ceiling, not an unrestricted command.\n- Consequence: Large instruction/manifests or line-dense diffs can fail initialization despite meaningful narrow edits; complete rendering/copying multiplies work. Marker ambiguity and explicit patch consent are integrity constraints to retain, not time limits.\n- Repair direction: Support bounded ranged source inspection and exact scalable diff/consent artifacts; separate retained file size from display/input capacity while preserving original bytes and preconditions. No tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQPFMo4V7isIiIishhaWvB+mwKeiu85szKep0c2U2uVk/XRfFlT/zpiuwmiy6iJvp/KUcSOSQbNoeQcOWL98ZoQg="}
