nregression: long provider outages and Retry-After, split transport chunks and large streams, ambiguous acceptance and duplicate events, cancellation during recovery, adapter restart and route changes, proving same-thread reconnection and no duplicated accepted request/effect. Exercise the precise source-described failure path and the relevant byte/count/elapsed boundaries listed in this finding, plus ordinary small inputs. Check that legitimate work progresses after the former blocker while malformed input, conflicting identity, stale preimages and unauthorized scope still reject. Add fault injection at the affected acceptance/publication/recovery boundary and run the affected integration and formal checks on the final implementation. Source-derived risks remain distinct from executed reproductions; completion requires this evidence, not a promise that a plan alone cannot break anything.","created_at":"2026-10-06T13:27:49.900Z","kind":"decision"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQA0Dlq/XJ6J+Aa+0yHybAwi2Aid/9gnbP4PVF0m+15z4dkg1HkHlBrOuJhwMfPHXmAK3S5ZjUtKToIV86HBo2A8="}
{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3417,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:51.728052864Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"e80c6b4d-26d3-511e-bd19-17f40c3836b5","title":"[L742] Public interaction observation writes whole run records and hides pending-input read failures","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L742.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/app/peritus-daemon/src/product_run/interaction/inputs.rs:8-45`; `src/product_run/interaction.rs:106-128,234-302,308-355`; `src/product_run/interaction/models.rs:7-57` in the same crate.\n- Behavior: query_interaction first synchronizes every not-yet-projected input revision; changed observations clone and synchronously write the whole run record while holding the global records write lock. Public activities are a bounded FIFO independent of durable input/reply archives. pending_interactive_input converts record-lock and pending_record_input failures to false. Terminal activity append failures are ignored. Model updates also persist under the records write lock, with rollback on write failure.\n- Consequence: an observation can hold other runs' record access during source replay and filesystem I/O. A damaged/unavailable pending-input capture can look like no pending work, leaving a waiting run without a surfaced recovery cause. FIFO activity history can disappear while the actual ledger remains durable; those two forms of persistence must not be conflated.\n- Repair direction: use incremental durable projections and publish immutable snapshots after I/O outside shared locks; represent pending-input inspection failure explicitly and keep recovery receipts. Retain no-false-acknowledgment rollback and original input authority. No tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNCAUHdCjgqg4V3bj2E/6TkzvEsrTquBWJElSl6zkhDYhgwRtUIl9kEPFQl+5TtASYFW2AvT460oBYGcwnFgmgo="}
