{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3419,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:51.732752811Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"7ce1dd5c-61ce-5b47-a935-3118f3268e32","title":"[L743] Public completion/tool rendering has bounded display loss without a complete-output continuation","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L743.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/app/peritus-daemon/src/product_run/interaction/presentation.rs:45-82`; `src/product_run/interaction/tool_activity.rs:18-71`; `src/product_run/interaction/tool_activity/display.rs:4-64,102-142`; `src/product_run/interaction/narration.rs:22-68`; `src/product_run/progress.rs:97-222` in the same crate.\n- Behavior: completed JSON envelopes render whole strings and then truncate via the activity byte budget; tool previews parse full JSON, redact recognizable credentials and retain bounded head/tail text. Tool completion pairs with one volatile pending_tool by name/sequence, and takes that pending record even on a name mismatch. Waiting notices update one existing status entry rather than counting elapsed time toward failure. Progress counters saturate and elapsed/quiet values are observational, not cancellation triggers.\n- Consequence: presentation expansion can cut a finding or run instruction despite exact lower-layer traces remaining elsewhere. Parallel/mismatched completion notices lose their prior public pending association, though they do not grant success authority. Removing timer language would not repair missing output continuation; conversely these elapsed counters do not need removal as execution deadlines.\n- Repair direction: make display truncation explicit with exact trace/source links and paged full content; key pending tool observations by durable invocation identity. Preserve privacy redaction, typed settlement authority, and nonfatal liveness updates. No tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNchG4U0ImoZR45++ULUujBFmsUf8cHpfkIIEwSnOGHWdvjMZbcY4Rc++sst9XeAHXGDngRmVGYdyiZLzRIb+Ak="}
