{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3441,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:51.781164376Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"25b1322b-c138-5356-bdfe-0e62d006d358","title":"[L754] Ordinary workbench error mapping discards causes and labels storage failures as backpressure","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L754.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/app/peritus-daemon/src/product_run/workbench.rs:298-322,367-390`; `src/product_run/workbench/images.rs:23-29`; `src/product_run/workbench/files.rs:86-128`; `src/product_run/workbench/folder_mutation/init.rs:14-46,90-97` in the same crate; L741.\n- Behavior: control I/O/journal errors map to Backpressure with no diagnostic; corruption/runner/workspace errors map to NotReady except Reobserve, and image daemon errors collapse mostly to NotReady. File source/model failures similarly collapse to identifier/feature errors. A single synchronous mutex serializes all control operations, including full archive scans and authorized folder mutation.\n- Consequence: ordinary user flows can receive pressure/retry instructions for persistent storage/corruption/authority failures, making repeated reconnect/read/retry actions look appropriate while the cause remains unresolved. Shared-owner blocking can affect independent conversations. These mappings are distinct from the more structured ProductRunServiceError path.\n- Repair direction: preserve typed recovery ownership, exact operation receipt and full cause reference; separate transient admission pressure from unresolved durable state. Keep exclusive serialization where required but perform verified projections and long I/O outside progress-critical mutex scopes. No tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFFRHAHyW0GDM0KLFpQKR+/uRqZDuNn/5X7ls6ka83vFfR8tfDhS+/jDGw6ijCGlTpU4hyDwznzlkqDQ5f73cgA="}
