{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3481,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:51.875881592Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"6e3a1049-b625-5fa8-8898-0baa7bdf2410","title":"[L800] Caption edits unnecessarily invalidate file previews, and multiline captions are rejected","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L800.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/app/peritus-tui/src/model/chat/workbench/files/keys.rs:1-126`, `files.rs:161-295`, `files/import.rs:71-94,222-279`, and `images/editor.rs:1-97`, all completely read.\n- Behavior: File field editing calls `discard_preview` after every editor key, including caption changes and cursor movement. A user who previews first, then enters the required caption, must preview/read again before confirmation. Image caption editing does not discard its byte preview. Both caption editors reject every Unicode control character on paste, including newline/tab, despite WorkbenchInputText supporting ordinary multiline text and the README promising multiline captions. Field limits are 4,096 path bytes, 80 file-range bytes, and 8,192 caption bytes. File preview/read acceptance checks destination and path but does not compare the current range/refresh draft to the request's range/refresh when an already-issued reply arrives.\n- Consequence: The file workflow can induce repeated reads without acceptance and can reject a normal pasted multiline instruction. An old range reply can become available after the range draft changed, although confirmation still carries the preview's exact original request. This is a UI state/consent mismatch, not a provider execution timeout.\n- Repair direction: Keep byte-preview consent stable across caption/cursor edits, allow inert newline/tab in caption text, and correlate incoming previews with the full current source/range/mode generation. Repreview only when bytes, selection, or authoritative provider binding changes.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFmEWGTnEXg8RDQr6QRpDQaGvZct4zwbQKmpk2XmWMk4j4zo+yN2JR31PlWOC7PPawJe+frKbDfgadv+ihmQxgs="}
