s, queue/connection pressure, delayed acknowledgements, subscription gaps, disconnect/reconnect and daemon restart, proving snapshot recovery, preserved selection/context, responsive controls and no duplicate command. Exercise the precise source-described failure path and the relevant byte/count/elapsed boundaries listed in this finding, plus ordinary small inputs. Check that legitimate work progresses after the former blocker while malformed input, conflicting identity, stale preimages and unauthorized scope still reject. Add fault injection at the affected acceptance/publication/recovery boundary and run the affected integration and formal checks on the final implementation. Source-derived risks remain distinct from executed reproductions; completion requires this evidence, not a promise that a plan alone cannot break anything.","created_at":"2026-10-06T13:27:49.900Z","kind":"decision"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFvr8tn8853Doql1DxAx8yhRTimkY/spBd4HB48CNhnURb9HWkbJ9v1VxOCQcpFEB+TXRtZheoEQHVkEGRorggs="}
{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3489,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:51.894399461Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"349759b7-037f-504f-9524-3a94cd71be71","title":"[L806] Web stop shares the send wait, while supposedly observational recovery can start execution","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L806.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/app/peritus-web/src/api.rs:100-168,181-214`; `src/operations.rs:13-60`, `src/daemon/chat.rs:35-65,67-201`, `src/daemon/receipts.rs:66-115,139-177,223-251` in that crate.\n- Behavior: send, control and model settings take the same conversation mutex for the entire awaited request pipeline. A missing reply holds it indefinitely; stop waits behind send. GET operation observation invokes recover_send, which drives create/queue/start/continuation and can retransmit an exact domain command. Observation does not take the operation/conversation guards used by mutations; manual acknowledgement calls observation first.\n- Consequence: a stalled submission can prevent cancellation through the same UI, and polling or review of an uncertain operation can cause execution rather than merely report its disposition. Concurrent recovery observes may race. Exact domain identities reduce duplicate effects but do not make this a read-only operation or prove native ownership recovery. Removing a timer alone leaves the shared-control blocker.\n- Repair direction: give controls and receipt inspection independent access to the owning operation, make observation read-only, and route explicitly authorized resume through serialized durable operation state. Preserve unknown-effect and exact-command fences.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHW/GqXyZe9eRj7kdslDPbDjfMfnlmc/k309pOvmYzJ1Pft5XLN0gywtW8L+nUl1dq76H0Vu66OL/jVGbTcGtQc="}
