{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3501,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:51.921984170Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"ec2f90a5-76fe-5897-9650-ecfb584d85bd","title":"[L812] Web presentation and HTTP bounds are separate from execution lifetime","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L812.\n\n- Evidence: `crates/app/peritus-web/src/config.rs:174-209`; `src/api.rs:25-41,130-140,224-244,315-350`, `src/files/pdf.rs:6-25`, `src/consoles.rs:53-69` in that crate.\n- Behavior: HTTP bodies cap at 4 MiB except the 50 MiB file-save route; operation IDs cap at 80 ASCII characters. Preferences accept font sizes 12–22, explorer widths 180–480, three themes, two densities and at most 100 aliases/shortcuts. Renamed titles cap at 256 bytes although the error says characters; new-session titles are not validated until the later daemon preparation. PDF identification inspects the first 1,024 bytes and downloads remain available. Console display titles/suggestions cap at 120 characters/32,768 bytes.\n- Consequence: these are representation/admission bounds, not run TTLs. The inconsistent title validation allows a locally created session that later cannot prepare a daemon conversation; configurable alias count and fixed dimensions can also refuse ordinary customization. Loopback origin/token checks, literal path confinement and invalid command rejection protect authority and should not be removed as timers.\n- Repair direction: use one validated title contract at creation/edit/preparation, document actual representation units, and make presentation/storage bounds adaptable without ending owned work. No tests were run during this source audit.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMENvA78bG4Nnw7isGkObekrm8hB+vI+MOqDXKmVBj8+W1Zu0EhRA9I42ZWVIn12DqvHGFjORXyXMd4TERrKjAs="}
