{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3503,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:51.926448906Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"06bb157b-8bc8-58a9-9714-15639919de8a","title":"[L814] Browser startup and polling can wait forever while recovery controls are hidden","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L814.\n\n- Evidence: `webui/src/lib/workspace.svelte.ts:42-70`, `117-180`, `235-252`; `webui/src/App.svelte:58-63`; `webui/src/lib/components/Recovery.svelte:1-21`; `webui/src/lib/components/FileViewer.svelte:1-89`.\n- Behavior: Startup awaits refresh, project Git/facts, poll, and operation reconciliation before releasing its loading gate. Each poll awaits status, consoles, facts, and every pending operation before refreshing conversations. The next timer is scheduled only after completion. Recovery controls hide during pending send/attachment or any Git action, and a pending check/save retains its disabled state until the response returns.\n- Consequence: One unresolved request can prevent conversation refresh, startup completion, or recovery access indefinitely. Removing timeouts does not provide independently owned cancellation, progress, or recovery. The 3500-ms refresh cadence is not a session deadline. This is source-derived; browser lockup has not been measured in this audit.\n- Repair direction: Make observations independent, retain durable effect identities, provide controls that remain reachable while an effect is unresolved, and let cancellation/reconciliation operate independently of the original request. Do not restore an arbitrary execution deadline. No tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQO2o7I4UPr11mvEHXdECJGyg/cfy16ETk80X14LNnK5HV7NPm7sdoFWQhRsAl9U4zXDspnxTgNCs+K7aiYQrDg8="}
