le and already owned effects reconcilable.\n\nAcceptance and nonregression: large histories and non-ASCII fields, queue/connection pressure, delayed acknowledgements, subscription gaps, disconnect/reconnect and daemon restart, proving snapshot recovery, preserved selection/context, responsive controls and no duplicate command. Exercise the precise source-described failure path and the relevant byte/count/elapsed boundaries listed in this finding, plus ordinary small inputs. Check that legitimate work progresses after the former blocker while malformed input, conflicting identity, stale preimages and unauthorized scope still reject. Add fault injection at the affected acceptance/publication/recovery boundary and run the affected integration and formal checks on the final implementation. Source-derived risks remain distinct from executed reproductions; completion requires this evidence, not a promise that a plan alone cannot break anything.","created_at":"2026-10-06T13:27:49.900Z","kind":"decision"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHadQXO4w7calVZVxvdX+3enH7cn9+JFzQxmyA1PXSRpyPiHQSOlLiUfxxn2mY3yjJJrxGfasMlaQo6Tq/4StAw="}
{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3505,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:51.931027695Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"bc66635d-6a3e-5c23-b97e-cb7ff924f294","title":"[L815] Browser recovery promises do not match recovery effects or persistence","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L815.\n\n- Evidence: `webui/src/lib/api.ts:1-62`; `webui/src/lib/operations.svelte.ts:1-16`; `webui/src/lib/files/drafts.svelte.ts:1-33`; `webui/src/lib/workspace.svelte.ts:161-180`; `webui/src/lib/components/Recovery.svelte:7-18`; gateway mutation evidence L806.\n- Behavior: Recovery messaging says nothing is repeated and that review only clears the receipt, while the queried gateway recovery path can transmit commands and start execution before acknowledgement. The browser stores operation identifiers and metadata in sessionStorage, not the original executable payload; file drafts and save snapshots exist only in module memory. Best-effort storage writes can fail silently, and sessionStorage enumeration is outside the restore catch.\n- Consequence: A user cannot rely on the advertised observational boundary, tab/crash continuity, or survival of an unresolved edit. A denied storage read can itself interrupt startup. Chat draft localStorage persistence is separate and does not make file drafts or native context durable.\n- Repair direction: Separate receipt inspection, explicit retry, and acknowledgement into distinct effects; persist exact unresolved payloads and file drafts under stable workspace/session identities, and surface storage failure. Preserve the rule against repeating an ambiguous effect without its original identity. No tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHgjoaNjlxxQ4pPLvwkl/Ay/d0y+V035u6P8fyb6LgErWgruNdwvVWKoH1KGEtpeCGbpjjf1ByLczdJ5mAZmQAU="}
{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3506,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:51.933311870Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"bc66635d-6a3e-5c23-b97e-cb7ff924f294","comment_uuid":"20921728-f738-4883-bafd-812ee84c2272","author":"6ME5","content":"Systemic repair plan for L815: Browser recovery promises do not match recovery effects or persistence.\n\nOwning contract and implementation boundary: webui/src/lib/api.ts:1-62; webui/src/lib/operations.svelte.ts:1-16; webui/src/lib/files/drafts.svelte.ts:1-33; webui/src/lib/workspace.svelte.ts:161-180; webui/src/lib/components/Recovery.svelte:7-18. Apply the change through the constructors, live callers, durable writer and restart reader for this boundary, not as an isolated constant increase.\n\nSeparate receipt inspection, explicit retry, and acknowledgement into distinct effects; persist exact unresolved payloads and file drafts under stable workspace/session identities, and surface storage failure. Preserve the rule against repeating an ambiguous effect without its original identity. No tests run.\n\nPreserve: committed command/event identity, exact causal and digest roots, exclusive ownership, atomic publication, reference-safe artifact retention and verified recovery from the last durable frontier. Separate a physical allocation/page limit and a genuine authority or integrity check from a cumulative work allowance. Keep transient contention/capacity observable and recoverable under the existing logical task; do not discard accepted state or substitute a fresh session to get around it.\n\nCompatibility/migration: retain decoders and exact receipts for previously accepted records. If representation or lifecycle semantics change, introduce a versioned migration under exclusive ownership; verify a complete replacement frontier before atomic publication and keep the old recovery root until adoption is durable. Rebuild derived projections from authoritative evidence. Update all producers, consumers and invariants together; a