{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3515,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:27:51.953588245Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"3f9cff72-ea7f-5a8b-a1e6-6faa8386968d","title":"[L820] Frontend paging does not bound whole-content work or preserve all editor state","description":"Source finding: docs/daily-driving-limiters-audit.md — L820.\n\n- Evidence: `webui/src/App.svelte:1-181`; `webui/src/lib/components/Markdown.svelte:1-13`; `webui/src/lib/components/Overlays.svelte:1-49`; `webui/src/lib/components/TextEditor.svelte:1-84`; `webui/src/lib/files/text.ts:1-29`; `webui/src/lib/components/FileViewer.svelte:1-89`; `webui/src/lib/components/PdfViewer.svelte:1-33`.\n- Behavior: Retained activities and collections are rendered in full; Markdown parsing/sanitization and persistence serialization are synchronous. File paging at 128000 UTF-16 units follows a whole-file fetch with original, normalized draft, and snapshot copies; page indexes, cursor positions, searches, and replacements inspect whole text. A page boundary can split a surrogate pair. Stale-result flags suppress rendering but do not cancel requests. Mixed newline editing is deliberately rejected to avoid rewriting format, while edits over 2 MiB use an explicit confirmation rather than a hard block.\n- Consequence: Large retained sessions/files can monopolize browser work despite paged display, and abandoned fetches still consume gateway resources. Presentation paging is not durable context recovery. Actual freeze or memory exhaustion has not been measured.\n- Repair direction: Preserve stable drafts, incrementally render/index contents, move expensive work off the input path, and cancel obsolete observations through their owners. Keep content-integrity safeguards distinct from arbitrary limits. No tests run.\n\nScope: implement and verify the systemic repair recorded in the decision comment. Source-derived behavior remains distinct from a reproduced live incident.","priority":"high","labels":["daily-driving-limiter"],"parent_uuid":"f89861db-18b8-4237-83e6-344f4e472dd4","created_by":"6ME5"},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQGK2ITAvwIZp21/UQtnknKktNpYUTq+fQmlbTMsf42x88mQ52a90r2nKTuLUIAeqUmzhJBb9iGqPpoiezjJGOAo="}
