{"agent_id":"6ME5","agent_seq":3633,"timestamp":"2026-10-06T22:47:34.321343719Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"7dba4e90-7fcd-4daa-b57b-1d3085aa762a","comment_uuid":"65c637a8-27c1-4e02-a499-de348adea6ec","author":"6ME5","content":"The observed process_spawn failure lost a second layer of evidence in provider-core: command.spawn discarded its io::Error before the provider bridge could retain it. Extend ProviderCoreError with private optional redacted I/O cause metadata (ErrorKind and numeric OS code only), additive accessors and a redacted standard Error::source; stable kind/code/operation/Display remain unchanged and no payload/path is retained. Attach this snapshot only at process_spawn, then include it in probe evidence. Deterministic regression pins then removes a private executable and verifies Connect/process_spawn/NotFound plus numeric cause with no path/canary leakage; a core unit test verifies custom I/O text is excluded from source/Debug/Display. Initial expanded isolated core/conformance/OpenAI suites passed after this addition. No root repair is chosen yet: 100 syscall-traced runs did not reproduce the spawn failure; new separate runs will stop at the first failure to capture the OS cause directly. No hidden retry or conformance-verdict replacement.","created_at":"2026-10-06T22:47:34.316989370Z","kind":"decision","signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAxCGc6giNWdNlW7qE3YGF8LYi7lUyvVtnkRMHQmoO/6QDcizpsqd+vYZEletSJuZ09anw9gxt2+5posyUO+CBDw=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:eV8eZPaZxut5mrkihmvsOTrGWClwD+B/HR//do+oIeI","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQq5MtA3gDv1stiLN1YhgJ9dMhoOBjZhbEednuPkV+1IAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQEtTqWpndFtzD+UV2JmyRsLhvWALGAclqzxVRHPwWdpD13UUY/+fq6jhS/U7OVSoJ3HuC